1
00:00:16,016 --> 00:00:19,919
{\an8}[announcer] <i>The winner of</i> I Am Boxer
<i>will receive a grand prize of 300 million</i>

2
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,156
{\an8}<i>and a top-of-the-line flagship SUV.</i>

3
00:00:26,026 --> 00:00:28,028
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

4
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,641
I Am Boxer.

5
00:00:41,642 --> 00:00:43,844
<i>Introducing our hosts!</i>

6
00:00:45,646 --> 00:00:47,714
[audience cheering, applauding]

7
00:01:11,338 --> 00:01:13,139
Hello, everyone.

8
00:01:13,140 --> 00:01:15,441
Welcome to
the blockbuster boxing survival show,

9
00:01:15,442 --> 00:01:19,179
- <i>I Am Boxer</i>.
- [audience cheering, applauding]

10
00:01:20,948 --> 00:01:22,615
At this stage on <i>I Am Boxer</i>,

11
00:01:22,616 --> 00:01:26,887
only four fighters remain in contention.

12
00:01:27,955 --> 00:01:31,223
You're basically looking at
the four best boxers

13
00:01:31,224 --> 00:01:33,659
in the country.

14
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:36,462
The semifinals will be contested
under boxing rules,

15
00:01:36,463 --> 00:01:38,464
eight rounds, three minutes per round.

16
00:01:38,465 --> 00:01:41,801
It's eight three-minute rounds, everyone.

17
00:01:41,802 --> 00:01:45,571
That's not something you get through

18
00:01:45,572 --> 00:01:47,139
on average stamina and skill.

19
00:01:47,140 --> 00:01:49,041
Well, there was a time I could go

20
00:01:49,042 --> 00:01:50,610
four rounds myself.

21
00:01:50,611 --> 00:01:51,978
[audience laughing]

22
00:01:51,979 --> 00:01:53,646
You could've played that up a bit.

23
00:01:53,647 --> 00:01:55,381
- You were too honest.
- [Lee] Unimpressive, huh?

24
00:01:55,382 --> 00:02:00,019
These four boxers have fought through
extremely intense competition to get here.

25
00:02:00,020 --> 00:02:02,221
We hope you'll look forward
to their semifinal bouts.

26
00:02:02,222 --> 00:02:05,124
The show that will ignite
a boxing boom in Korea,

27
00:02:05,125 --> 00:02:06,493
<i>I Am Boxer...</i>

28
00:02:07,327 --> 00:02:08,694
starts now.

29
00:02:08,695 --> 00:02:11,264
[audience cheering, applauding]

30
00:02:15,035 --> 00:02:16,670
{\an8}CHO HYUNJAE

31
00:02:19,006 --> 00:02:20,474
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN

32
00:02:21,875 --> 00:02:23,276
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN

33
00:02:24,845 --> 00:02:25,879
{\an8}KWON OHGON

34
00:02:26,346 --> 00:02:28,848
{\an8}EPISODE 9

35
00:02:28,849 --> 00:02:32,718
[Jongkook] Before we get started
on the semifinals,

36
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:34,321
Dex and I have prepared

37
00:02:34,921 --> 00:02:38,290
a very special match for you.

38
00:02:38,291 --> 00:02:39,592
[♪ rhythmic music playing]

39
00:02:39,593 --> 00:02:41,027
{\an8}PARK YOUNGHO, PARK SEONGJUN

40
00:02:41,028 --> 00:02:42,495
[Youngho] Hey, hey, hey.

41
00:02:42,496 --> 00:02:43,729
[Jongkook] Hey, you two. [laughing]

42
00:02:43,730 --> 00:02:45,598
- [Youngho] Hello, sir.
- Good to see you again.

43
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:48,467
- Good to see you, Youngho, Underdog.
- Long time no see.

44
00:02:48,468 --> 00:02:50,469
It's been a while, hasn't it?

45
00:02:50,470 --> 00:02:53,773
Personally, I was really sorry
to see you both go.

46
00:02:53,774 --> 00:02:57,511
So we've decided to bring you in
for a two-on-two tag team match

47
00:02:58,011 --> 00:02:59,679
- at the semifinals.
- Ah...

48
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,447
- So we're a team?
- That's right.

49
00:03:01,448 --> 00:03:03,582
But before we start the workout,

50
00:03:03,583 --> 00:03:04,650
I brought a drink

51
00:03:04,651 --> 00:03:06,385
- to boost your energy levels.
- [Youngho, Seongjun cheer]

52
00:03:06,386 --> 00:03:07,454
All right.

53
00:03:08,321 --> 00:03:10,489
- [Youngho, Seongjun] Ah...
- Here you go.

54
00:03:10,490 --> 00:03:12,159
- Looks familiar, huh?
- [Youngho, Seongjun] Oh...

55
00:03:12,826 --> 00:03:14,427
- A quick toast?
- [Seongjun] Shall we?

56
00:03:14,428 --> 00:03:16,495
- We Koreans never skip a toast, huh?
- [laughing]

57
00:03:16,496 --> 00:03:17,763
Even with soft drinks.

58
00:03:17,764 --> 00:03:20,066
- All right, good luck, boys!
- [Youngho] Cheers.

59
00:03:20,067 --> 00:03:21,134
All right!

60
00:03:22,703 --> 00:03:23,703
Bottoms up?

61
00:03:23,704 --> 00:03:26,172
- [Seongjun chuckles]
- [Youngho coughs]

62
00:03:26,173 --> 00:03:28,241
Hey, this actually tastes good. Huh?

63
00:03:28,775 --> 00:03:30,476
Can an energy drink taste this good?

64
00:03:30,477 --> 00:03:31,911
Man, it's good.

65
00:03:31,912 --> 00:03:33,312
So today,

66
00:03:33,313 --> 00:03:37,617
you'll be facing a pair chosen by Dex.

67
00:03:38,218 --> 00:03:40,453
Just for today,
you'll be competing as Team Dex.

68
00:03:40,454 --> 00:03:41,754
PARK SUNGWOON, LEE GIJUN

69
00:03:41,755 --> 00:03:44,356
- That's the setup.
- [Sungwoon] Yes!

70
00:03:44,357 --> 00:03:46,592
But before we start,
you haven't eaten yet, right?

71
00:03:46,593 --> 00:03:47,993
[Sungwoon] Right, I'm starving.

72
00:03:47,994 --> 00:03:51,331
[Dex] You've got to load up on
your protein and carbs before a workout.

73
00:03:51,865 --> 00:03:52,866
[Sungwoon] Hmm.

74
00:03:54,601 --> 00:03:55,802
[Sungwoon, Gijun] Mmm.

75
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:57,970
- Mmm.
- Mmm!

76
00:03:57,971 --> 00:03:59,573
Tastes amazing! Mmm.

77
00:04:00,173 --> 00:04:01,474
You're not skipping meals

78
00:04:01,475 --> 00:04:03,175
- or anything, are you? [chuckles]
- [exclaims]

79
00:04:03,176 --> 00:04:05,745
If you eat chicken breast all the time,

80
00:04:05,746 --> 00:04:07,613
- you get sick of it pretty fast.
- Hmm.

81
00:04:07,614 --> 00:04:09,916
- But this is in noodle form...
- [Sungwoon, Gijun grunt]

82
00:04:10,517 --> 00:04:13,552
...so it's great for people
who's sick of eating chicken breast.

83
00:04:13,553 --> 00:04:15,254
Chicken breast can be a bit dry...

84
00:04:15,255 --> 00:04:17,957
- [Dex] Right.
- ...but not this, since it's in noodle form.

85
00:04:17,958 --> 00:04:19,025
It's really good.

86
00:04:19,559 --> 00:04:21,127
I kind of want one more,

87
00:04:21,128 --> 00:04:23,563
- but I shouldn't overdo it.
- [Dex] Right, one's just right.

88
00:04:24,231 --> 00:04:25,564
- Let's do well today.
- [Sungwoon] Hmm.

89
00:04:25,565 --> 00:04:26,933
- Let's go, team.
- [Gijun grunts]

90
00:04:27,667 --> 00:04:28,968
[Dex] Good luck, you two.

91
00:04:28,969 --> 00:04:30,469
- Let's go for it today.
- Yes.

92
00:04:30,470 --> 00:04:34,406
[Jongkook] This match will be two rounds,
three minutes each.

93
00:04:34,407 --> 00:04:37,977
Before we start,
let's hear it from both teams.

94
00:04:37,978 --> 00:04:39,813
How are you feeling going into this?

95
00:04:40,647 --> 00:04:44,016
First off, I can see that
Park Youngho has an incredible body.

96
00:04:44,017 --> 00:04:45,718
But those muscles are just for show.

97
00:04:45,719 --> 00:04:47,653
I'll deflate them a bit today.

98
00:04:47,654 --> 00:04:52,424
People say bodybuilding muscles
are vanity muscles and such,

99
00:04:52,425 --> 00:04:55,895
but I'll show how powerful they really are

100
00:04:55,896 --> 00:04:57,329
in an actual fight.

101
00:04:57,330 --> 00:04:58,899
[audience cheering, applauding]

102
00:05:00,467 --> 00:05:01,902
[audience gasps]

103
00:05:02,736 --> 00:05:04,203
[Jongkook] Oh.

104
00:05:04,204 --> 00:05:05,604
Oh, well said.

105
00:05:05,605 --> 00:05:08,340
Ah, things are already heating up
before the bell.

106
00:05:08,341 --> 00:05:11,010
{\an8}Let's get ready for the special
two-on-two tag team match.

107
00:05:11,011 --> 00:05:12,878
There's a subtle mind game going on.

108
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:14,713
Neither side knows who's fighting first.

109
00:05:14,714 --> 00:05:17,317
- [Lee] Fighters, step in.
- [audience exclaims]

110
00:05:19,686 --> 00:05:21,354
{\an8}[Dex] I see. It's those two.

111
00:05:21,855 --> 00:05:25,257
{\an8}[Seungheon] I was wondering
who would be the first to enter the ring.

112
00:05:25,258 --> 00:05:27,994
{\an8}So these two are the opening matchup.

113
00:05:28,795 --> 00:05:30,863
[Gyuwon] This is power versus power.

114
00:05:30,864 --> 00:05:33,133
It's going to be an explosive fight
from the start.

115
00:05:33,733 --> 00:05:36,468
[Youngho]
<i>"Could I really lose to these kids?"</i>

116
00:05:36,469 --> 00:05:39,706
"Me, losing a fight?"
I did wonder a little about that.

117
00:05:40,273 --> 00:05:41,740
[Sungwoon] <i>I keep things light and fun,</i>

118
00:05:41,741 --> 00:05:43,843
<i>but my punches definitely won't be.</i>

119
00:05:43,844 --> 00:05:47,112
They'll see I'm not to be taken lightly.

120
00:05:47,113 --> 00:05:48,280
[♪ tense music playing]

121
00:05:48,281 --> 00:05:50,550
[referee] Face each other.
Watch for headbutts.

122
00:05:51,151 --> 00:05:53,019
- [♪ humorous music plays]
- [audience laughing]

123
00:05:56,356 --> 00:05:57,357
What in the...

124
00:05:59,459 --> 00:06:00,593
[Jaehyuk] He seems like a funny guy.

125
00:06:00,594 --> 00:06:01,928
- He's a real character.
- Right.

126
00:06:02,529 --> 00:06:03,529
To your corners.

127
00:06:03,530 --> 00:06:05,364
[Jongkook] Here we go.
This is gonna be fun.

128
00:06:05,365 --> 00:06:06,499
[person] This should be good.

129
00:06:08,902 --> 00:06:10,102
- [screams]
- [audience cheers]

130
00:06:10,103 --> 00:06:14,073
[Gyuwon] That's Park Sungwoon
trying to intimidate his opponent.

131
00:06:14,074 --> 00:06:17,576
- Ah. This is going to be an exciting one!
- [audience cheering, applauding]

132
00:06:17,577 --> 00:06:18,844
Box!

133
00:06:18,845 --> 00:06:20,813
{\an8}- [bell rings]
- [referee] Box!

134
00:06:20,814 --> 00:06:23,015
{\an8}PARK YOUNGHO X PARK SUNGWOON

135
00:06:23,016 --> 00:06:25,050
{\an8}[Seungheon] And we're underway.

136
00:06:25,051 --> 00:06:26,853
{\an8}Park Sungwoon versus Park Youngho.

137
00:06:27,854 --> 00:06:30,222
{\an8}There's about an 18-year age gap.

138
00:06:30,223 --> 00:06:32,025
Park Sungwoon initiates the attack!

139
00:06:33,426 --> 00:06:34,426
[audience cheers]

140
00:06:34,427 --> 00:06:36,795
[Gyuwon] His counterpunching
is looking very sharp right now.

141
00:06:36,796 --> 00:06:38,665
- [Sungwoon] Yes, let it loose!
- [Dex exclaims]

142
00:06:39,432 --> 00:06:40,500
[Seungheon] Nice right hand!

143
00:06:41,201 --> 00:06:43,369
- [Lee exclaims]
- It's okay! Keep going!

144
00:06:43,370 --> 00:06:46,506
[Youngho] <i>Wow.
He was throwing hard from the start.</i>

145
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,909
<i>I was like,
"Well, would you look at that?"</i>

146
00:06:50,277 --> 00:06:52,611
[Seungheon]
Park Sungwoon keeps provoking him.

147
00:06:52,612 --> 00:06:54,346
Toongsoon's guard is looking shaky.

148
00:06:54,347 --> 00:06:56,182
Sungwoon, tighten your guard!

149
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:58,385
- Feels like he'll gas pretty soon.
- [laughs]

150
00:06:59,219 --> 00:07:00,319
- To the body.
- No, no, no.

151
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:02,321
- [person 1] Toongsoon's tired.
- [person 2] Nice shot!

152
00:07:02,322 --> 00:07:03,989
- Hey, that's it!
- [Lee exclaims]

153
00:07:03,990 --> 00:07:05,557
- [person] Let's go!
- [Seungheon] Oh!

154
00:07:05,558 --> 00:07:07,426
The left hand connects this time!

155
00:07:07,427 --> 00:07:08,929
Good going!

156
00:07:10,263 --> 00:07:12,299
- [Jongkook] Nice! There you go!
- [Seongjun exclaims]

157
00:07:13,300 --> 00:07:14,534
[Lee] Toongsoon's gassed.

158
00:07:15,101 --> 00:07:17,904
- [person 1] Man, he's gassed out.
- [person 2] He's spent already.

159
00:07:19,372 --> 00:07:20,640
[person 3] Come on, come on!

160
00:07:22,075 --> 00:07:23,310
[Dex laughs]

161
00:07:24,344 --> 00:07:26,412
- [person 1] What was that?
- [Jongkook] Hey, Toongsoon's done!

162
00:07:26,413 --> 00:07:27,681
[person 2 laughs]

163
00:07:30,116 --> 00:07:31,351
[person 4] Just like that?

164
00:07:32,819 --> 00:07:34,320
What the heck?

165
00:07:34,321 --> 00:07:36,889
[Seungheon] Park Sungwoon chose
to burn through his stamina

166
00:07:36,890 --> 00:07:38,924
and make the tag.

167
00:07:38,925 --> 00:07:40,727
{\an8}BLUE CORNER SWITCH: LEE GIJUN

168
00:07:42,028 --> 00:07:43,730
[audience cheering, applauding]

169
00:07:47,334 --> 00:07:48,467
You good?

170
00:07:48,468 --> 00:07:49,568
Can you go on?

171
00:07:49,569 --> 00:07:52,405
- How many minutes in?
- We're around halfway through.

172
00:07:52,973 --> 00:07:56,008
[Seungheon]
Park Youngho hasn't made the tag yet.

173
00:07:56,009 --> 00:08:00,113
{\an8}PARK YOUNGHO X LEE GIJUN

174
00:08:02,248 --> 00:08:04,651
{\an8}Lee Gijun has good footwork, though.

175
00:08:05,585 --> 00:08:07,820
[Gyuwon] Park Youngho won't have much room

176
00:08:07,821 --> 00:08:09,589
- to work against Lee Gijun.
- [audience gasps]

177
00:08:11,324 --> 00:08:13,459
[Seungheon] Lee taps the guard up top.

178
00:08:13,460 --> 00:08:15,929
Lands on the body and slides out!

179
00:08:16,863 --> 00:08:18,330
- [person 1 gasps]
- [person 2 exclaims]

180
00:08:18,331 --> 00:08:20,799
[Gyuwon] Ah.
That was a great hook from Lee Gijun!

181
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,601
[exclaims]

182
00:08:22,602 --> 00:08:24,770
[Gyuwon] If he doesn't change his rhythm
with confidence,

183
00:08:24,771 --> 00:08:26,538
he's just going to sink deeper.

184
00:08:26,539 --> 00:08:28,307
[Dex, person exclaim]

185
00:08:28,308 --> 00:08:29,376
[Jongkook] Clipped him on the chin.

186
00:08:29,943 --> 00:08:31,578
Youngho can't seem to read Gijun's rhythm.

187
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,948
He's a bit slow, that's the problem.

188
00:08:36,516 --> 00:08:39,386
- [person] Hey!
- [Seungheon] Excellent roll right there.

189
00:08:39,953 --> 00:08:41,388
Now that's a pro boxer!

190
00:08:42,522 --> 00:08:43,522
{\an8}[clapping]

191
00:08:43,523 --> 00:08:45,457
{\an8}- [Seongjun] Ten seconds!
- [Dex] Ten seconds!

192
00:08:45,458 --> 00:08:47,626
{\an8}Gijun, circle out of there!

193
00:08:47,627 --> 00:08:49,361
{\an8}Circle out, circle out!

194
00:08:49,362 --> 00:08:51,197
{\an8}- That's it!
- [audience gasps]

195
00:08:51,798 --> 00:08:53,298
{\an8}- [Lee] Hey!
- [bell rings]

196
00:08:53,299 --> 00:08:54,366
{\an8}Stop!

197
00:08:54,367 --> 00:08:56,001
{\an8}[Seungheon] And the first round has ended!

198
00:08:56,002 --> 00:08:59,705
- Youngho went one whole round.
- He did.

199
00:08:59,706 --> 00:09:01,373
Youngho's got solid stamina.

200
00:09:01,374 --> 00:09:04,176
Looks like he decided
to go the full round.

201
00:09:04,177 --> 00:09:05,978
I never thought
I'd see a match like this in Korea.

202
00:09:05,979 --> 00:09:07,046
Huh?

203
00:09:07,047 --> 00:09:08,581
- This is pretty fun.
- Yeah.

204
00:09:09,449 --> 00:09:11,283
[Gyuwon] Just looking at the first round,

205
00:09:11,284 --> 00:09:15,587
you can tell both corners came in
with very different strategies.

206
00:09:15,588 --> 00:09:19,091
I'm curious to see
which approach will pay off.

207
00:09:19,092 --> 00:09:22,796
Sungwoon, you go out first,
empty the tank, then tag out!

208
00:09:23,363 --> 00:09:24,963
[Jongkook] I think he's done for the day.

209
00:09:24,964 --> 00:09:26,765
- Can I tag out in 30 seconds?
- [Jongkook laughs]

210
00:09:26,766 --> 00:09:28,100
Make that one minute!

211
00:09:28,101 --> 00:09:29,601
Just one minute, man!

212
00:09:29,602 --> 00:09:31,071
- That's a bit much, sir!
- [laughs]

213
00:09:32,405 --> 00:09:33,740
[whistle sounds]

214
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,774
- [exclaims, grunts]
- [audience] Oh!

215
00:09:35,775 --> 00:09:36,909
[audience laughs]

216
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:38,510
{\an8}- [exclaims, grunts]
- [audience] Oh!

217
00:09:38,511 --> 00:09:39,878
{\an8}[audience laughs]

218
00:09:39,879 --> 00:09:43,016
{\an8}PARK SEONGJUN'S WIFE

219
00:09:45,885 --> 00:09:48,188
Nice, nice! That was entertaining!

220
00:09:48,755 --> 00:09:50,489
- [exclaims, grunts]
- [audience] Oh!

221
00:09:50,490 --> 00:09:51,624
[audience laughs]

222
00:09:52,926 --> 00:09:54,694
- [laughs]
- [audience cheering, applauding]

223
00:10:05,638 --> 00:10:07,706
- He wanted to have his own moment.
- [Jongkook] Good.

224
00:10:07,707 --> 00:10:09,776
Nice one, Sungwoon! Now show them! Fight!

225
00:10:10,743 --> 00:10:14,113
[Gyuwon] Showing that kind of confidence
in the ring like that...

226
00:10:14,114 --> 00:10:16,582
{\an8}- It's a real gift!
- [bell rings]

227
00:10:16,583 --> 00:10:17,950
{\an8}- [referee] Box!
- [Youngho] Let's go!

228
00:10:17,951 --> 00:10:20,519
{\an8}PARK SEONGJUN X PARK SUNGWOON

229
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:23,489
[Seungheon] Now, it's Park Sungwoon
versus Park Seongjun!

230
00:10:23,490 --> 00:10:24,623
[Jongkook] All right!

231
00:10:24,624 --> 00:10:25,925
[Seungheon] It's speed versus power.

232
00:10:26,993 --> 00:10:29,194
Locked in right now,
he's probing with his punches.

233
00:10:29,195 --> 00:10:30,697
- [referee] Break!
- [Seungheon] Park Sungwoon.

234
00:10:34,634 --> 00:10:36,835
- [Dex] Whoa.
- Wow. Nice shot.

235
00:10:36,836 --> 00:10:38,204
[♪ intense music playing]

236
00:10:39,506 --> 00:10:41,206
[Gyuwon]
Park Sungwoon may be a heavyweight,

237
00:10:41,207 --> 00:10:44,610
but as you saw just now,
his sense of timing and speed is great.

238
00:10:44,611 --> 00:10:45,677
[Seungheon exclaims]

239
00:10:45,678 --> 00:10:47,580
- [Dex] Ooh.
- [Lee] Boy, he keeps getting caught.

240
00:10:48,148 --> 00:10:49,249
[Jongkook] Cover up!

241
00:10:50,083 --> 00:10:52,185
Cover up tight. No, cover up.

242
00:10:53,219 --> 00:10:55,420
[Lee] That's dangerous.
Given his weight, if that lands...

243
00:10:55,421 --> 00:10:56,989
- [audience gasps]
- Hey!

244
00:10:56,990 --> 00:10:58,391
Man, this is bad.

245
00:10:59,192 --> 00:11:01,627
Sungwoon, pour everything out! This is it!

246
00:11:01,628 --> 00:11:03,463
There you go! [exclaims]

247
00:11:04,063 --> 00:11:05,698
- [Lee] Hey.
- [Dex] Hey, hey.

248
00:11:06,499 --> 00:11:09,468
- [Seungheon] That looks dangerous.
- [Dex] That's it, Sungwoon! Doing well!

249
00:11:09,469 --> 00:11:11,137
[Lee] He's burning through his energy.

250
00:11:12,372 --> 00:11:13,806
- [Dex] Here he goes.
- [Jongkook exclaims]

251
00:11:14,374 --> 00:11:15,374
[audience gasps]

252
00:11:15,375 --> 00:11:17,876
[Gyuwon] Those glancing punches
are dangerous if they land!

253
00:11:17,877 --> 00:11:19,612
[Dex] Let's go, Park Sungwoon!

254
00:11:21,848 --> 00:11:23,316
[Youngho] Last one, last one!

255
00:11:23,883 --> 00:11:25,518
{\an8}[Dex] Sungwoon, your minute's up!

256
00:11:26,186 --> 00:11:27,687
{\an8}Hey, your minute's up!

257
00:11:28,454 --> 00:11:30,088
{\an8}- [Youngho] Keep it up!
- [audience gasps]

258
00:11:30,089 --> 00:11:31,924
- Nice, that's it!
- [audience gasps]

259
00:11:31,925 --> 00:11:33,493
He's coming in blind!

260
00:11:34,294 --> 00:11:37,563
[Seungheon] Both fighters are exchanging
punches here while clearly fatigued.

261
00:11:37,564 --> 00:11:39,365
[Youngho] No big deal!
Just pillow punches!

262
00:11:39,866 --> 00:11:41,266
He's gassed, man!

263
00:11:41,267 --> 00:11:43,202
- [referee] Break, break.
- [audience] Go, Sungwoon!

264
00:11:43,203 --> 00:11:44,604
He's totally spent.

265
00:11:45,238 --> 00:11:47,940
[Seungheon] Park Sungwoon
doesn't even have the energy

266
00:11:47,941 --> 00:11:49,742
to keep his guard up at this point.

267
00:11:51,010 --> 00:11:52,245
Down, down!

268
00:11:55,415 --> 00:11:59,184
- [referee] Down! Three, four!
- What? I was just playing it up!

269
00:11:59,185 --> 00:12:02,020
- [referee] Five, six!
- [audience laughs]

270
00:12:02,021 --> 00:12:04,756
Seven, eight! Come on.

271
00:12:04,757 --> 00:12:06,258
[Jongkook] A knockdown from exhaustion.

272
00:12:06,259 --> 00:12:08,460
- He fell down because he's out of gas.
- [laughing]

273
00:12:08,461 --> 00:12:09,862
- That's a down.
- [audience applauding]

274
00:12:10,830 --> 00:12:13,366
{\an8}[Gyuwon] And now,
he's made the smart decision to tag out.

275
00:12:14,734 --> 00:12:15,734
Hey, go ahead and tag out!

276
00:12:15,735 --> 00:12:17,069
- Tag out.
- [referee] Box!

277
00:12:17,070 --> 00:12:19,938
[Gyuwon] Against a fast fighter
like Park Seongjun, he must've burned

278
00:12:19,939 --> 00:12:21,841
a tremendous amount of energy.

279
00:12:22,842 --> 00:12:24,077
[audience exclaiming]

280
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:28,747
Oh, no!

281
00:12:28,748 --> 00:12:30,148
- Here he comes.
- [Dex] Great!

282
00:12:30,149 --> 00:12:31,617
Here comes the real Park Youngho.

283
00:12:31,618 --> 00:12:33,819
- There he is.
- [Jongkook] Right.

284
00:12:33,820 --> 00:12:35,388
- He's revving it up.
- [Lee] Yeah.

285
00:12:37,257 --> 00:12:38,958
[Dex] It's like two bulls are colliding.

286
00:12:41,194 --> 00:12:42,794
Come on! Bring it on!

287
00:12:42,795 --> 00:12:44,830
[Jongkook] Nice, nice. That's it.

288
00:12:44,831 --> 00:12:46,366
Pressure him! Don't let him tag out!

289
00:12:47,066 --> 00:12:49,369
- [Dex] Hey...
- [audience laughing]

290
00:12:51,838 --> 00:12:53,039
[cheering]

291
00:12:53,706 --> 00:12:56,742
- [person] Nice! That's it!
- [Jongkook laughing]

292
00:12:56,743 --> 00:12:57,810
[referee] Stop!

293
00:12:59,712 --> 00:13:00,713
[Lee] He tagged out.

294
00:13:01,881 --> 00:13:02,949
No!

295
00:13:03,549 --> 00:13:05,584
No, that's it for him!

296
00:13:05,585 --> 00:13:08,421
{\an8}[Jongkook] Now this is entertainment,
all right!

297
00:13:08,955 --> 00:13:12,158
[Lee] But Gijun carried the whole round
earlier. He can't just tag out like that.

298
00:13:13,293 --> 00:13:15,127
{\an8}- [Seungheon] And now Lee Gijun is in!
- [referee] Box!

299
00:13:15,128 --> 00:13:16,628
{\an8}Lee Gijun versus Park Youngho!

300
00:13:16,629 --> 00:13:20,433
{\an8}[Gyuwon] He's the opponent
Park Youngho struggles with the most.

301
00:13:21,501 --> 00:13:23,235
- [Seungheon] Nice body shot!
- [♪ intense music playing]

302
00:13:23,236 --> 00:13:24,837
[Dex] Gijun, work the body! That's it!

303
00:13:26,639 --> 00:13:28,741
[Lee] Which will it be?
Rhythm or one-shot power?

304
00:13:29,676 --> 00:13:33,079
[Seungheon] Lee Gijun is increasing
his punch output to rack up more points.

305
00:13:34,013 --> 00:13:35,014
- Now this... Whoa!
- [Gyuwon] Ah!

306
00:13:37,784 --> 00:13:38,784
[audience gasps]

307
00:13:38,785 --> 00:13:41,520
[Lee]
Gijun has a really unconventional rhythm.

308
00:13:41,521 --> 00:13:43,288
[Seungheon]
Lee Gijun is using his footwork

309
00:13:43,289 --> 00:13:44,723
to slip away from the punches.

310
00:13:44,724 --> 00:13:46,124
[Dex] That's it! Nice body shot!

311
00:13:46,125 --> 00:13:47,660
That landed!

312
00:13:48,161 --> 00:13:50,496
[Gyuwon] Lee Gijun boxes with rhythm.

313
00:13:51,264 --> 00:13:54,100
He reads his opponent's rhythm
and doesn't miss a single opening.

314
00:13:54,934 --> 00:13:56,969
[Lee] Nice, he's staying right on him.

315
00:14:00,406 --> 00:14:02,108
[person] Nice! That's it!

316
00:14:02,842 --> 00:14:05,678
[Dex] Doing well, Gijun! That's it!

317
00:14:06,245 --> 00:14:07,714
Gijun's not eating the big shots.

318
00:14:09,982 --> 00:14:11,183
{\an8}- [Lee] Yes, that's it.
- [tapping]

319
00:14:11,184 --> 00:14:13,151
{\an8}[person] Ten seconds! Ten seconds!

320
00:14:13,152 --> 00:14:16,288
{\an8}[Gyuwon] Last ten seconds!
This is where you score the highest!

321
00:14:16,289 --> 00:14:17,889
{\an8}They've got to go all out!

322
00:14:17,890 --> 00:14:19,158
{\an8}[Seungheon] Time's almost up!

323
00:14:19,659 --> 00:14:20,792
{\an8}Lee Gijun strikes!

324
00:14:20,793 --> 00:14:22,794
{\an8}- [bell rings]
- Park Youngho dips!

325
00:14:22,795 --> 00:14:25,431
{\an8}- And the match is over!
- [audience applauding]

326
00:14:28,201 --> 00:14:29,369
[Dex] Well fought.

327
00:14:33,106 --> 00:14:35,807
I can't even tell which team won.
[chuckles]

328
00:14:35,808 --> 00:14:38,010
[Lee] Great job, everyone.

329
00:14:39,011 --> 00:14:40,813
Let me announce the result.

330
00:14:42,181 --> 00:14:44,984
The winners
of the two-on-two tag team match,

331
00:14:46,185 --> 00:14:48,054
by a score of two to one...

332
00:14:52,058 --> 00:14:55,694
{\an8}- Blue corner, Park Sungwoon and Lee Gijun.
- [audience cheering]

333
00:14:55,695 --> 00:14:58,164
{\an8}BLUE CORNER PARK SUNGWOON, LEE GIJUN WIN

334
00:15:00,032 --> 00:15:02,902
[Jongkook] Thank you, all.
Please give all four fighters a big hand!

335
00:15:08,474 --> 00:15:11,276
If the special match was this fun,

336
00:15:11,277 --> 00:15:13,311
imagine how good the main bout will be.

337
00:15:13,312 --> 00:15:14,747
Today's been a blast so far.

338
00:15:15,515 --> 00:15:17,283
The semifinals of <i>I Am Boxer.</i>

339
00:15:17,884 --> 00:15:20,819
Let the first bout begin.

340
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:22,922
[audience applauding, cheering]

341
00:15:28,995 --> 00:15:30,262
[♪ intense music playing]

342
00:15:30,263 --> 00:15:35,367
[Dex] Entering from the blue corner,
Pretty Boy, Cho Hyunjae!

343
00:15:35,368 --> 00:15:37,002
{\an8}[cheering]

344
00:15:37,003 --> 00:15:39,337
{\an8}CHO HYUNJAE'S FAMILY

345
00:15:39,338 --> 00:15:42,742
CHO HYUNJAE

346
00:15:53,352 --> 00:15:56,488
[Seungheon] The first fighter
of the first semifinal match!

347
00:15:56,489 --> 00:15:59,524
Cho Hyunjae is now entering the arena!

348
00:15:59,525 --> 00:16:03,962
[Gyuwon] This is a fighter
who saves the show for the ring!

349
00:16:03,963 --> 00:16:06,698
- [Seungheon] That's right!
- [Gyuwon] He's got sharp ring IQ,

350
00:16:06,699 --> 00:16:09,634
and he displays real magic
through his footwork.

351
00:16:09,635 --> 00:16:12,671
- He surprised us in the quarterfinals.
- Absolutely!

352
00:16:12,672 --> 00:16:15,174
[Gyuwon] His ring IQ is incredibly high!

353
00:16:19,345 --> 00:16:21,647
All right, there's our boy.

354
00:16:23,249 --> 00:16:25,183
- [Lee] Looking light on his feet.
- [Dex] Nice!

355
00:16:25,184 --> 00:16:27,052
- [Lee] Really light.
- [Dex] Great.

356
00:16:27,053 --> 00:16:28,221
[audience applauding]

357
00:16:30,389 --> 00:16:31,490
[Lee] Love what I'm seeing.

358
00:16:31,491 --> 00:16:33,125
- I'm feeling nervous.
- [Lee] He looks good.

359
00:16:36,996 --> 00:16:38,130
[Hyunjae's mother] Pretty gloves.

360
00:16:38,664 --> 00:16:41,501
[Jongkook] The fighter facing Cho Hyunjae.

361
00:16:42,635 --> 00:16:49,140
Entering from the red corner,
Body Killer, Kuk Seungjun!

362
00:16:49,141 --> 00:16:50,575
{\an8}[audience cheering, applauding]

363
00:16:50,576 --> 00:16:53,079
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN'S PARENTS

364
00:16:57,383 --> 00:16:59,684
[Seungjun's sister] I was so nervous
watching him last time.

365
00:16:59,685 --> 00:17:00,753
Isn't he impressive?

366
00:17:01,254 --> 00:17:02,587
He's really impressive.

367
00:17:02,588 --> 00:17:04,390
KUK SEUNGJUN

368
00:17:09,495 --> 00:17:11,097
[applauding]

369
00:17:14,967 --> 00:17:16,202
[audience cheering]

370
00:17:16,802 --> 00:17:19,638
[Seungheon] And now,
here comes the second fighter!

371
00:17:19,639 --> 00:17:20,740
It is Kuk Seungjun!

372
00:17:21,307 --> 00:17:24,609
[Gyuwon] He's a fighter
with relentless determination

373
00:17:24,610 --> 00:17:27,146
- and incredible mental toughness.
- [Seungheon] That's right.

374
00:17:29,282 --> 00:17:31,317
[Gyuwon] He's got outstanding technique.

375
00:17:31,884 --> 00:17:35,387
In mid-range exchanges,
he never gives up an opening,

376
00:17:35,388 --> 00:17:37,188
and in his previous six-round bout,

377
00:17:37,189 --> 00:17:41,294
he overwhelmed his opponent
with nonstop combos to the very end.

378
00:17:43,329 --> 00:17:46,698
So far, he's been inside fighting
the majority of the time.

379
00:17:46,699 --> 00:17:50,001
Against opponents with a clear skill gap,

380
00:17:50,002 --> 00:17:53,272
he's shown great confidence
working on the inside.

381
00:17:53,806 --> 00:17:55,575
[audience applauding continues]

382
00:17:59,345 --> 00:18:01,013
[Seungjun's sister cheering]

383
00:18:06,485 --> 00:18:08,454
{\an8}- [person 1] Let's go, Cho Hyunjae!
- [person 2] Let's go!

384
00:18:11,223 --> 00:18:13,959
I hate to see two of my favorite fighters

385
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:16,094
go up against each other.

386
00:18:16,095 --> 00:18:18,296
It's tough knowing only one can win.

387
00:18:18,297 --> 00:18:20,665
Anyhow, I'll be cheering for them both

388
00:18:20,666 --> 00:18:21,801
all the way to the end.

389
00:18:22,501 --> 00:18:25,838
[announcer] <i>In the blue corner,
wearing the white trunks.</i>

390
00:18:26,339 --> 00:18:29,008
<i>Standing 177 cm tall,</i>

391
00:18:29,508 --> 00:18:31,777
<i>weighing in at 65 kg.</i>

392
00:18:32,278 --> 00:18:35,146
<i>From Seoul PE Middle and High School,</i>

393
00:18:35,147 --> 00:18:37,617
<i>former member
of the Yongin University boxing team.</i>

394
00:18:38,117 --> 00:18:41,353
<i>The 2025 Korean Boxing Association
President's Cup</i>

395
00:18:41,354 --> 00:18:43,289
<i>lightweight silver medalist!</i>

396
00:18:43,789 --> 00:18:45,691
<i>A member of the KAFAC,</i>

397
00:18:46,359 --> 00:18:49,462
<i>and</i> I Am Boxer's <i>top out-boxer!</i>

398
00:18:49,962 --> 00:18:52,732
<i>Please give it up for Pretty Boy,</i>

399
00:18:53,299 --> 00:18:58,370
{\an8}- <i>Cho Hyunjae!</i>
- [cheering, applauding]

400
00:18:58,371 --> 00:19:00,905
{\an8}CHO HYUNJAE

401
00:19:00,906 --> 00:19:02,975
[cheering]

402
00:19:06,912 --> 00:19:09,981
[announcer] <i>In the red corner,
wearing the silver trunks.</i>

403
00:19:09,982 --> 00:19:12,784
<i>Standing 186 cm tall,</i>

404
00:19:12,785 --> 00:19:15,388
<i>weighing in at 70 kg.</i>

405
00:19:16,088 --> 00:19:19,057
<i>The 2024 National Sports Festival</i>

406
00:19:19,058 --> 00:19:21,060
<i>welterweight boxing gold medalist.</i>

407
00:19:21,627 --> 00:19:23,329
<i>From the Hwasun County boxing team,</i>

408
00:19:23,863 --> 00:19:26,932
I Am Boxer's <i>top infighter!</i>

409
00:19:27,667 --> 00:19:30,302
<i>Please give it up for Body Killer,</i>

410
00:19:30,903 --> 00:19:35,540
{\an8}- <i>Kuk Seungjun!</i>
- [cheering]

411
00:19:35,541 --> 00:19:36,841
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN

412
00:19:36,842 --> 00:19:39,411
{\an8}[Jonghoon] All right, Seungjun!
Just have fun with it!

413
00:19:39,412 --> 00:19:40,479
{\an8}Nice!

414
00:19:42,481 --> 00:19:44,116
[Lee exclaims]

415
00:19:45,017 --> 00:19:46,851
How did they even make it this far?

416
00:19:46,852 --> 00:19:48,988
- [Dex] Seriously. How?
- [audience exclaims]

417
00:19:49,622 --> 00:19:51,257
KONKUK UNIVERSITY MEDICAL CENTER

418
00:19:51,991 --> 00:19:53,392
[Hyunjae's mother] Hey, Hyunjae!

419
00:19:54,193 --> 00:19:55,428
[Hyunjae's mother chuckles]

420
00:19:56,762 --> 00:19:57,930
{\an8}CHO HYUNJAE'S MOTHER

421
00:20:00,966 --> 00:20:02,835
- Did you come to see me?
- Yeah.

422
00:20:03,335 --> 00:20:04,570
[chuckles]

423
00:20:05,571 --> 00:20:08,039
You've been training hard? Oh.

424
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:09,808
Who are you facing in the semifinals?

425
00:20:09,809 --> 00:20:12,043
Body Killer, Kuk Seungjun. Remember him?

426
00:20:12,044 --> 00:20:15,413
That tall, good-looking guy?

427
00:20:15,414 --> 00:20:17,716
- Oh. [exclaims]
- I'm facing him.

428
00:20:17,717 --> 00:20:21,052
His reach and height could be

429
00:20:21,053 --> 00:20:22,520
a disadvantage for you, huh?

430
00:20:22,521 --> 00:20:24,090
- [chuckles]
- I'm confident.

431
00:20:25,458 --> 00:20:28,728
It's a three-minute eight-rounder,
so it'll come down to conditioning.

432
00:20:29,228 --> 00:20:32,097
Then I'll get you something good today

433
00:20:32,098 --> 00:20:34,232
to help with your conditioning.

434
00:20:34,233 --> 00:20:35,568
Let's go eat.

435
00:20:38,938 --> 00:20:39,972
[♪ cheerful music playing]

436
00:20:40,473 --> 00:20:41,473
[Hyunjae] There you are.

437
00:20:41,474 --> 00:20:43,141
Oh, you're here.

438
00:20:43,142 --> 00:20:45,211
[Hyunjae] Was the traffic awful?

439
00:20:45,778 --> 00:20:47,212
It wasn't too bad for us.

440
00:20:47,213 --> 00:20:49,515
- We hit some traffic.
- I see.

441
00:20:50,082 --> 00:20:51,784
Oh, something's coming.

442
00:20:52,384 --> 00:20:54,185
[Hyunjae's brother]
Since we know what you like,

443
00:20:54,186 --> 00:20:55,653
we went ahead and ordered in advance.

444
00:20:55,654 --> 00:20:58,657
- What do you think? Looks good, right?
- [laughs]

445
00:20:59,759 --> 00:21:00,860
[Hyunjae] It's good.

446
00:21:01,627 --> 00:21:02,762
It's delicious.

447
00:21:03,329 --> 00:21:04,529
Hmm. It's good, isn't it?

448
00:21:04,530 --> 00:21:05,664
Help yourselves.

449
00:21:08,868 --> 00:21:09,902
[sighs]

450
00:21:10,836 --> 00:21:12,570
- Are you feeling nervous?
- [♪ gentle music playing]

451
00:21:12,571 --> 00:21:14,405
It's the semifinals.

452
00:21:14,406 --> 00:21:16,442
And I've never gone eight rounds before.

453
00:21:17,009 --> 00:21:19,110
I won't really know how it feels
until I'm in there,

454
00:21:19,111 --> 00:21:20,479
so I'm really worried.

455
00:21:21,647 --> 00:21:25,617
- I wrote you a heartfelt letter.
- For real?

456
00:21:25,618 --> 00:21:28,086
Don't read it now.
Read it before the match tomorrow.

457
00:21:28,087 --> 00:21:29,989
I hope it gives you strength.

458
00:21:30,489 --> 00:21:32,824
[Hyunjae] "To my Hyunjae,
who I hope always lives in the present."

459
00:21:32,825 --> 00:21:35,293
"From Mom." Oh.

460
00:21:35,294 --> 00:21:36,795
I'll stay focused on the present

461
00:21:36,796 --> 00:21:40,799
and make sure you see me win tomorrow.

462
00:21:40,800 --> 00:21:41,866
All right.

463
00:21:41,867 --> 00:21:43,068
- Got it.
- [brother] Good luck.

464
00:21:44,303 --> 00:21:45,738
[family] Let's go!

465
00:21:46,405 --> 00:21:47,572
[producer] You should read

466
00:21:47,573 --> 00:21:49,275
- your mother's letter now.
- Oh, come on.

467
00:21:50,643 --> 00:21:52,278
[♪ soft music playing]

468
00:21:59,618 --> 00:22:00,619
[sniffles]

469
00:22:02,521 --> 00:22:05,324
[Hyunjae] <i>"I've always hoped you could
follow your own path."</i>

470
00:22:05,991 --> 00:22:07,092
<i>"I'm on your side."</i>

471
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:10,895
{\an8}<i>She called herself</i> The Giving Tree<i>.</i>

472
00:22:10,896 --> 00:22:12,064
{\an8}<i>That hit me hard.</i>

473
00:22:13,232 --> 00:22:16,601
I want to give it my all
and show them my very best.

474
00:22:16,602 --> 00:22:19,537
Mom, you'll cheer for me again, right?

475
00:22:19,538 --> 00:22:21,807
I'll go out there and put up a good fight.

476
00:22:22,808 --> 00:22:25,144
From the moment I started boxing,

477
00:22:25,744 --> 00:22:29,882
my mother always emphasized
that hard work always pays off.

478
00:22:30,850 --> 00:22:34,619
In today's match,
I hope to show her how hard I've worked.

479
00:22:34,620 --> 00:22:35,688
- Thank you.
- [parents cheer]

480
00:22:38,824 --> 00:22:41,593
Next then,
let's hear from red corner Kuk Seungjun.

481
00:22:41,594 --> 00:22:44,796
The reason I was able to make it this far
and stand here today

482
00:22:44,797 --> 00:22:47,633
is all thanks to my family's support.

483
00:22:49,001 --> 00:22:50,168
[♪ gentle music playing]

484
00:22:50,169 --> 00:22:52,872
[Seungjun's sister]
Do people put this in kimchi stew?

485
00:22:53,339 --> 00:22:54,607
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN'S FATHER

486
00:22:55,074 --> 00:22:56,241
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN'S MOTHER,
BROTHER-IN-LAW

487
00:22:56,242 --> 00:22:58,277
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN'S SISTER

488
00:23:01,947 --> 00:23:03,715
- All right, let's dig in.
- [applauding]

489
00:23:03,716 --> 00:23:05,250
[brother-in-law] Thank you for the food.

490
00:23:05,251 --> 00:23:07,151
- Thank you for the food.
- [father] Let's eat.

491
00:23:07,152 --> 00:23:09,888
[sister] Braised short ribs
and spicy stir-fried pork, your favorite.

492
00:23:09,889 --> 00:23:11,123
They look great.

493
00:23:19,098 --> 00:23:20,465
Mmm. It's delicious.

494
00:23:20,466 --> 00:23:22,301
[sister] Help yourself.
There's plenty more.

495
00:23:23,235 --> 00:23:25,738
Look at this.
Seungjun with a little top knot.

496
00:23:26,305 --> 00:23:28,306
He's the prettiest in the family.

497
00:23:28,307 --> 00:23:30,775
He's handsome and pretty.

498
00:23:30,776 --> 00:23:31,943
[mother] Hmm.

499
00:23:31,944 --> 00:23:34,279
This was when your mother was sick.

500
00:23:34,280 --> 00:23:36,348
Right after she was discharged
from the hospital.

501
00:23:37,283 --> 00:23:40,618
It wasn't long after
Seungjun started boxing

502
00:23:40,619 --> 00:23:42,788
that your mom got sick.

503
00:23:44,056 --> 00:23:46,391
- Acute liver... cirrhosis.
- [sister] Liver cirrhosis.

504
00:23:46,392 --> 00:23:48,227
End-stage.

505
00:23:48,961 --> 00:23:51,230
[father]
The boxing team brought their own lunches.

506
00:23:51,931 --> 00:23:54,399
But Seungjun had no one to pack his lunch,

507
00:23:54,400 --> 00:23:56,435
given the circumstances.

508
00:24:00,706 --> 00:24:02,241
Even now, when I think about it...

509
00:24:02,975 --> 00:24:04,443
It was really tough.

510
00:24:06,779 --> 00:24:07,947
[sighs]

511
00:24:08,547 --> 00:24:10,049
It was really tough back then.

512
00:24:12,551 --> 00:24:14,620
That's what you say, that it was tough.

513
00:24:15,287 --> 00:24:18,623
But I was grateful
just to be able to keep boxing.

514
00:24:18,624 --> 00:24:22,794
If I managed to endure such hardships,

515
00:24:22,795 --> 00:24:26,197
I know I should keep moving forward.

516
00:24:26,198 --> 00:24:28,634
Those memories are what keep me going,
so thank you.

517
00:24:30,669 --> 00:24:31,770
[mother] Thank you, son.

518
00:24:34,573 --> 00:24:36,040
[sister] Oh, I just had a great idea.

519
00:24:36,041 --> 00:24:39,610
These are the gloves
he's going to wear in the semifinals.

520
00:24:39,611 --> 00:24:43,147
Let's write messages on this.

521
00:24:43,148 --> 00:24:45,049
Then he'll wear this in the semifinals

522
00:24:45,050 --> 00:24:47,618
and draw strength from us.

523
00:24:47,619 --> 00:24:49,521
[father] I like that. Let's do it.

524
00:24:52,992 --> 00:24:55,561
JJUN, SHINE IN THAT RING!
WE'LL ALWAYS BE THERE FOR YOU!

525
00:25:00,299 --> 00:25:02,600
[Seungjun] <i>My dad's message said,</i>

526
00:25:02,601 --> 00:25:07,172
<i>"You'll forever be
my one and only champion."</i>

527
00:25:08,173 --> 00:25:10,975
<i>I felt bad,
but so grateful at the same time.</i>

528
00:25:10,976 --> 00:25:13,045
<i>I think all the emotions
just came flooding in.</i>

529
00:25:14,046 --> 00:25:16,682
[sister] Why are you crying?
You're making me sad.

530
00:25:17,483 --> 00:25:19,751
- Comfort him, will you?
- [sniffles]

531
00:25:19,752 --> 00:25:21,053
Go and comfort him.

532
00:25:22,788 --> 00:25:26,458
[Seungjun]
<i>These gloves are like a lucky charm.</i>

533
00:25:27,292 --> 00:25:31,629
With them on, I feel like
I could face anything without fear.

534
00:25:31,630 --> 00:25:33,297
JJUN, SHINE IN THAT RING!
WE'LL ALWAYS BE THERE FOR YOU!

535
00:25:33,298 --> 00:25:34,766
MY ONE AND ONLY CHAMP
I LOVE YOU, SON

536
00:25:34,767 --> 00:25:35,934
[Seungjun] Mom and Dad,

537
00:25:36,702 --> 00:25:39,570
let's win again
and head to the finals together.

538
00:25:39,571 --> 00:25:40,706
[audience cheering]

539
00:25:42,841 --> 00:25:44,877
[Jongkook]
Fighters, prepare for the match.

540
00:25:46,879 --> 00:25:48,846
[Dex] Our blue corner fighter,
Cho Hyunjae,

541
00:25:48,847 --> 00:25:52,183
is clearly on another level
when it comes to tempo.

542
00:25:52,184 --> 00:25:55,820
His hard-to-read movement
is his biggest strength.

543
00:25:55,821 --> 00:25:58,322
[Jongkook] With Kuk Seungjun
in the red corner,

544
00:25:58,323 --> 00:26:00,492
the way he times his body shots
is pure art.

545
00:26:01,060 --> 00:26:03,961
[Gyuwon] Both fighters specialize
in three-minute three-round fights.

546
00:26:03,962 --> 00:26:05,029
[Seungheon] Exactly.

547
00:26:05,030 --> 00:26:07,732
With this being a three-minute,
eight-round fight,

548
00:26:07,733 --> 00:26:11,103
strategy is going to matter
more than anything today.

549
00:26:11,603 --> 00:26:13,971
Throw a lot of feints.
Work the body with a jab.

550
00:26:13,972 --> 00:26:17,308
Just try everything at first.
Let's see how he reacts.

551
00:26:17,309 --> 00:26:18,910
- [Jonghoon] He's a lightweight, right?
- Yeah.

552
00:26:18,911 --> 00:26:20,178
[Jonghoon] So he's smaller.

553
00:26:20,179 --> 00:26:22,880
Even so, loading up for a one-shot KO
will only make you swing big

554
00:26:22,881 --> 00:26:23,981
and burn more energy.

555
00:26:23,982 --> 00:26:25,750
- Fight him at his pace.
- Okay.

556
00:26:25,751 --> 00:26:27,985
- [Jonghoon] He's pretty quick, okay?
- Got it.

557
00:26:27,986 --> 00:26:29,121
Who's your bet?

558
00:26:30,289 --> 00:26:32,990
Early on, I can see this guy winning.

559
00:26:32,991 --> 00:26:34,759
- In the later rounds...
- Since he's fast?

560
00:26:34,760 --> 00:26:37,496
Yeah, if his stamina holds.

561
00:26:37,996 --> 00:26:40,731
[Hyunjae] <i>There's no turning back now.</i>

562
00:26:40,732 --> 00:26:43,768
I'll fight with everything I have

563
00:26:43,769 --> 00:26:45,937
until my white gloves are soaked red.

564
00:26:45,938 --> 00:26:47,972
[Seungjun]
<i>No matter what, I will win today</i>

565
00:26:47,973 --> 00:26:51,142
<i>and move a step closer
to that championship belt.</i>

566
00:26:51,143 --> 00:26:52,677
I want my family at the finals,

567
00:26:52,678 --> 00:26:54,113
and I'll make it happen.

568
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:57,381
[Gyuwon] Which fighter
will take control of the flow?

569
00:26:57,382 --> 00:26:58,983
I can't wait to find out.

570
00:26:58,984 --> 00:27:01,787
[Jongkook] The semifinals of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

571
00:27:02,554 --> 00:27:04,889
Let the bout begin!

572
00:27:04,890 --> 00:27:06,825
- [♪ tense music playing]
- [audience cheering]

573
00:27:11,363 --> 00:27:13,131
- Box!
- [bell rings]

574
00:27:13,132 --> 00:27:15,333
{\an8}[Seungheon]
Okay, the first round has begun.

575
00:27:15,334 --> 00:27:17,369
{\an8}Cho Hyunjae versus Kuk Seungjun.

576
00:27:17,936 --> 00:27:20,371
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN X CHO HYUNJAE

577
00:27:20,372 --> 00:27:21,639
{\an8}[Seungheon] Kuk's got that long reach.

578
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:23,975
{\an8}Even among fighters
in the same weight class,

579
00:27:23,976 --> 00:27:26,378
{\an8}he's known for his long reach.

580
00:27:28,580 --> 00:27:29,780
[Jihyun] That's it!

581
00:27:29,781 --> 00:27:31,215
Yes, keep going like that!

582
00:27:31,216 --> 00:27:33,017
[Seungheon]
Cho Hyunjae slides out on his footwork.

583
00:27:33,018 --> 00:27:35,153
He's backing out, staying mobile.

584
00:27:35,154 --> 00:27:36,587
Meanwhile, Kuk's pressing inward.

585
00:27:36,588 --> 00:27:38,524
- [Jongkook] He's pressing hard.
- [Lee] That's right.

586
00:27:39,024 --> 00:27:40,191
[audience cheering]

587
00:27:40,192 --> 00:27:41,826
- [Jonghoon] All right!
- [audience gasps]

588
00:27:41,827 --> 00:27:43,028
[Jonghoon] Nice shot!

589
00:27:43,662 --> 00:27:44,830
[audience cheering]

590
00:27:48,734 --> 00:27:50,602
They've traded shots.

591
00:27:51,236 --> 00:27:53,171
[Seungjun]
<i>Cho Hyunjae is exceptionally fast</i>

592
00:27:53,172 --> 00:27:54,939
<i>and excels as an out-boxer,</i>

593
00:27:54,940 --> 00:27:57,509
<i>so my strategy was
to add constant forward pressure.</i>

594
00:27:58,310 --> 00:28:00,278
- [Seungheon] There it is. He strikes.
- [Jongkook] Ow. Ow.

595
00:28:00,279 --> 00:28:02,113
[Gyuwon] Ah.
Kuk's throwing very aggressively.

596
00:28:02,114 --> 00:28:03,848
- [Jongkook] Whoa, that body shot!
- [Lee] That went in.

597
00:28:03,849 --> 00:28:05,383
- Man, that landed.
- [Jonghoon] Nice, Seungjun!

598
00:28:05,384 --> 00:28:06,450
Well done, Seungjun!

599
00:28:06,451 --> 00:28:08,452
- It's only the first round...
- Wait, look.

600
00:28:08,453 --> 00:28:09,988
Kuk Seungjun's doing good.

601
00:28:10,656 --> 00:28:12,423
[Hyunjae's father] Hyunjae, keep circling!

602
00:28:12,424 --> 00:28:14,560
- [Hyunjae's mother] Take it slow!
- [Hyunjae's father] Slow down!

603
00:28:16,261 --> 00:28:17,895
- That's it!
- [Hyunjae's father] Yes! There you go!

604
00:28:17,896 --> 00:28:20,164
Stay calm! You're doing fine!

605
00:28:20,165 --> 00:28:23,067
[Hyunjae] <i>My strategy is to figure out
exactly how close I need to be</i>

606
00:28:23,068 --> 00:28:24,435
<i>for my shots to land,</i>

607
00:28:24,436 --> 00:28:27,772
<i>and keep moving more.</i>

608
00:28:27,773 --> 00:28:31,475
[Gyuwon] Cho Hyunjae is using the ring,
not giving his opponent any openings.

609
00:28:31,476 --> 00:28:33,878
He's circling the ring to pick his shots.

610
00:28:33,879 --> 00:28:37,448
Whereas Kuk is holding the center,
constantly driving Lee to the corner.

611
00:28:37,449 --> 00:28:38,783
[Seungheon] All right!

612
00:28:38,784 --> 00:28:40,818
[Jonghoon] Yes, that's it! Nice!

613
00:28:40,819 --> 00:28:43,020
Great lead hook!

614
00:28:43,021 --> 00:28:44,655
Keep working in the clinch! Yes!

615
00:28:44,656 --> 00:28:46,325
- Go, go!
- Just keep pounding!

616
00:28:49,261 --> 00:28:51,295
- [Jihyun] All right! That's it!
- [audience cheers]

617
00:28:51,296 --> 00:28:53,097
[Hyunjae's father] There you go!

618
00:28:53,098 --> 00:28:56,534
[Jongkook] The range is slightly too short
for Kuk Seungjun.

619
00:28:56,535 --> 00:28:58,270
[audience] All right!

620
00:28:59,271 --> 00:29:00,439
[audience exclaiming]

621
00:29:02,374 --> 00:29:04,642
[Lee] Seungjun should stay put
and plant his feet.

622
00:29:04,643 --> 00:29:06,345
[Jihyun] All right! Keep going!

623
00:29:06,845 --> 00:29:08,579
- That's it!
- [Hyunjae] Nice!

624
00:29:08,580 --> 00:29:10,448
He's an infighter, all right!

625
00:29:10,449 --> 00:29:12,216
- [Jihyun] All right!
- [audience gasps]

626
00:29:12,217 --> 00:29:13,284
Nice shot!

627
00:29:13,285 --> 00:29:14,652
[Jihyun] One more, one more!

628
00:29:14,653 --> 00:29:16,488
His counter landed.

629
00:29:17,723 --> 00:29:19,024
[Jihyun] Yes, that's it!

630
00:29:20,192 --> 00:29:21,692
[Seungheon] Another one!

631
00:29:21,693 --> 00:29:23,028
Hyunjae, doing well!

632
00:29:23,729 --> 00:29:25,696
- [Jihyun] Hyunjae, you're doing good!
- [Seungheon] Cho Hyunjae...

633
00:29:25,697 --> 00:29:27,665
His shots are landing with great accuracy!

634
00:29:27,666 --> 00:29:29,667
- [Jonghoon] Seungjun, you're doing fine.
- Don't let him out.

635
00:29:29,668 --> 00:29:31,402
- Nice.
- Yeah, doing good.

636
00:29:31,403 --> 00:29:34,805
Seungjun shouldn't try to match his speed.

637
00:29:34,806 --> 00:29:38,277
He needs to fight like he did
in the opening exchanges.

638
00:29:38,777 --> 00:29:41,947
If he tries to match the pace,
his punches start to lag.

639
00:29:44,616 --> 00:29:45,616
{\an8}Yes, that's it!

640
00:29:45,617 --> 00:29:48,220
{\an8}Man, he swung too big.

641
00:29:48,954 --> 00:29:50,154
{\an8}[Seungheon] He's going for it.

642
00:29:50,155 --> 00:29:52,323
{\an8}Nice slip-and-rip there!
He's holding his ground!

643
00:29:52,324 --> 00:29:53,391
{\an8}- And letting it fly!
- [bell rings]

644
00:29:53,392 --> 00:29:55,092
{\an8}- [referee] Stop!
- [Lee] Hey.

645
00:29:55,093 --> 00:29:56,794
{\an8}[Seungheon] And that concludes the round.

646
00:29:56,795 --> 00:29:59,430
{\an8}[Gyuwon]
That was a really impressive first round.

647
00:29:59,431 --> 00:30:03,401
Cho Hyunjae is trying to keep
Kuk Seungjun in check right now

648
00:30:03,402 --> 00:30:06,237
with his footwork and punch selection.

649
00:30:06,238 --> 00:30:09,040
Meanwhile, Kuk Seungjun is looking
to shut down Cho Hyunjae's momentum

650
00:30:09,041 --> 00:30:11,676
with heavy shots, one punch at a time.

651
00:30:11,677 --> 00:30:13,278
[cheering] Well done!

652
00:30:17,883 --> 00:30:20,584
At first,
Cho Hyunjae looked a little rattled.

653
00:30:20,585 --> 00:30:22,887
For about the first minute or so.

654
00:30:22,888 --> 00:30:25,890
But he adjusted quickly
and changed his game plan.

655
00:30:25,891 --> 00:30:27,326
He looks more composed now.

656
00:30:27,793 --> 00:30:29,660
Kuk Seungjun felt a bit rushed later on.

657
00:30:29,661 --> 00:30:30,795
Yeah, he was rushing.

658
00:30:30,796 --> 00:30:32,263
Manage your energy,

659
00:30:32,264 --> 00:30:34,865
and keep controlling the pace
like you are now.

660
00:30:34,866 --> 00:30:36,467
If you pressure him,

661
00:30:36,468 --> 00:30:38,169
he's going to back up and turn out.

662
00:30:38,170 --> 00:30:39,570
That's your moment.

663
00:30:39,571 --> 00:30:42,606
Do what you're good at.
Work the lead hand to the body.

664
00:30:42,607 --> 00:30:45,643
[Seungjun] <i>Late in the round,
Cho Hyunjae surprised me</i>

665
00:30:45,644 --> 00:30:47,411
<i>by stepping inside my range.</i>

666
00:30:47,412 --> 00:30:50,548
- <i>That actually put me at a disadvantage.</i>
- [♪ tense music playing]

667
00:30:50,549 --> 00:30:53,818
[Seungjun] <i>I kept thinking,
"Do I keep going in and throwing punches?"</i>

668
00:30:53,819 --> 00:30:56,922
<i>"Or do I pull back
and fight on the outside?"</i>

669
00:30:57,456 --> 00:30:59,190
He's swinging big. Keep that in mind.

670
00:30:59,191 --> 00:31:00,991
You trade with him, you have the edge.

671
00:31:00,992 --> 00:31:02,927
When you land clean and step out,

672
00:31:02,928 --> 00:31:04,595
and he chases after you like this.

673
00:31:04,596 --> 00:31:06,497
- That's when he catches you.
- Got it.

674
00:31:06,498 --> 00:31:08,799
So don't back straight up.
Slide to the side instead

675
00:31:08,800 --> 00:31:10,401
when you get out. Got it?

676
00:31:10,402 --> 00:31:12,036
Stay calm and take it slow.

677
00:31:12,037 --> 00:31:13,537
Remember, calm and slow.

678
00:31:13,538 --> 00:31:18,075
{\an8}This should be tough for both fighters,
given that this is an eight-round fight.

679
00:31:18,076 --> 00:31:20,177
{\an8}Let's see how they play this second round.

680
00:31:20,178 --> 00:31:22,314
{\an8}- And the second round...
- [referee] Box!

681
00:31:22,848 --> 00:31:23,881
{\an8}- ...begins now.
- [clamoring]

682
00:31:23,882 --> 00:31:25,383
{\an8}ROUND 2 OF 8
KUK SEUNGJUN X CHO HYUNJAE

683
00:31:25,384 --> 00:31:27,418
- [spectator 1] Go, get in there!
- [spectator 2] Let's go!

684
00:31:27,419 --> 00:31:29,487
[Seungheon] Kuk Seungjun's hunting
for something big!

685
00:31:29,488 --> 00:31:31,189
Cho goes to the body and ties him up.

686
00:31:31,757 --> 00:31:33,023
[spectator] That's it!

687
00:31:33,024 --> 00:31:34,392
[Hyunjae supporter] What the?

688
00:31:34,393 --> 00:31:35,494
[gasps]

689
00:31:35,994 --> 00:31:37,996
[♪ tense music playing]

690
00:31:40,165 --> 00:31:41,632
[Seungheon] Wow, they're going at it!

691
00:31:41,633 --> 00:31:43,134
[Lee] He's getting caught.

692
00:31:43,135 --> 00:31:44,502
He caught that clean.

693
00:31:44,503 --> 00:31:46,003
[coach] This is your range, you're good!

694
00:31:46,004 --> 00:31:47,873
[Seungheon] Cho Hyunjae is
full-on infighting!

695
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:50,241
- That's it!
- Add the hook!

696
00:31:50,242 --> 00:31:51,742
<i>He was taller than I'd expected.</i>

697
00:31:51,743 --> 00:31:53,811
<i>My jabs from the outside
just weren't landing,</i>

698
00:31:53,812 --> 00:31:56,281
