the fifth round,

927
00:41:23,548 --> 00:41:26,049
Cho Hyunjae's footwork
is still going strong.

928
00:41:26,050 --> 00:41:27,451
[clamoring continues]

929
00:41:27,452 --> 00:41:29,753
[Seungheon] Cho Hyunjae is still looking

930
00:41:29,754 --> 00:41:31,955
to make use of his footwork here.

931
00:41:31,956 --> 00:41:33,123
[Jonghoon] Nice shot!

932
00:41:33,124 --> 00:41:35,193
[Seungheon] He's letting him know
that didn't hurt.

933
00:41:36,594 --> 00:41:40,497
[Seungjun] <i>I was honestly surprised to see
Hyunjae still have that kind of stamina.</i>

934
00:41:40,498 --> 00:41:44,068
<i>I thought he'd be drained by then, but...</i>

935
00:41:44,635 --> 00:41:45,902
[exclaims]

936
00:41:45,903 --> 00:41:47,604
[spectator 1] Work the lead hand! Go now!

937
00:41:47,605 --> 00:41:49,907
[Lee] Four rounds in,
and he's still bouncing around.

938
00:41:50,675 --> 00:41:52,576
Hyunjae's gas tank is unreal.

939
00:41:52,577 --> 00:41:55,012
- Absolutely.
- [Lee] It's seriously impressive.

940
00:41:55,013 --> 00:41:57,748
[Seungheon] Cho Hyunjae's footwork is
starting to pick up again.

941
00:41:57,749 --> 00:42:00,317
Cho's looking to hit and move.
He blocks the left hand nicely.

942
00:42:00,318 --> 00:42:01,651
Kuk Seungjun stays on him.

943
00:42:01,652 --> 00:42:03,053
He swings big but misses.

944
00:42:03,054 --> 00:42:04,154
[clamoring continues]

945
00:42:04,155 --> 00:42:05,622
[Seungheon] That body shot landed!

946
00:42:05,623 --> 00:42:06,758
From Cho Hyunjae.

947
00:42:08,026 --> 00:42:11,561
[Hyunjae] <i>By the fifth round,
Kuk Seungjun was clearly tired.</i>

948
00:42:11,562 --> 00:42:13,697
<i>Stamina-wise, I still felt strong,</i>

949
00:42:13,698 --> 00:42:15,899
<i>so I decided to rely on my footwork.</i>

950
00:42:15,900 --> 00:42:17,801
- Let's go, Cho Hyunjae!
- Let's go, Cho Hyunjae!

951
00:42:17,802 --> 00:42:19,736
- Let's go, Hyunjae!
- [Hyunjae supporter] Let's go!

952
00:42:19,737 --> 00:42:21,571
[♪ intense music playing]

953
00:42:21,572 --> 00:42:23,074
[coach] Hyunjae, you can close in!

954
00:42:25,610 --> 00:42:26,744
Down and up!

955
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:30,881
- All right!
- That's it!

956
00:42:30,882 --> 00:42:32,517
Yes, bam-bam! One-two!

957
00:42:34,585 --> 00:42:36,020
[spectator] Tighten your guard!

958
00:42:36,654 --> 00:42:38,489
[Seungheon] This time,
Cho's left hand lands!

959
00:42:39,991 --> 00:42:41,125
He's going for a big one!

960
00:42:41,926 --> 00:42:43,126
[spectators exclaim]

961
00:42:43,127 --> 00:42:44,361
[Jonghoon] It's fine! Keep it up!

962
00:42:44,362 --> 00:42:46,830
[Seungheon] This time,
Hyunjae steps forward aggressively.

963
00:42:46,831 --> 00:42:48,399
- Go in now!
- [clamoring continues]

964
00:42:50,668 --> 00:42:53,638
{\an8}[Jongkook] All of a sudden,
Seungjun's turned into an out-fighter.

965
00:42:54,672 --> 00:42:56,007
{\an8}[Lee] He's gassed right now.

966
00:42:56,974 --> 00:42:58,175
{\an8}[Jongkook] That's it!

967
00:42:58,176 --> 00:42:59,677
{\an8}[Seungheon] Now, to the head!

968
00:43:01,546 --> 00:43:05,149
{\an8}[Gyuwon] That one-two keeps landing today!

969
00:43:06,818 --> 00:43:08,552
{\an8}- Come on, bring it on!
- [bell dings]

970
00:43:08,553 --> 00:43:10,455
{\an8}[Seungheon] And just like that,
the fifth round ends.

971
00:43:12,490 --> 00:43:14,391
{\an8}Seungjun's tired now.

972
00:43:14,392 --> 00:43:16,626
{\an8}- He hit a wall all at once.
- Seungjun is... Yeah.

973
00:43:16,627 --> 00:43:18,929
- Hyunjae's turned into the infighter.
- [Jongkook] Right, right.

974
00:43:18,930 --> 00:43:21,998
This could be
where Hyunjae makes his comeback.

975
00:43:21,999 --> 00:43:23,100
{\an8}The sixth round is on.

976
00:43:23,101 --> 00:43:25,302
{\an8}[Gyuwon] From here,
it's a real test of mental toughness.

977
00:43:25,303 --> 00:43:27,504
{\an8}We're in the back half of the bout now.

978
00:43:27,505 --> 00:43:29,674
[spectators clamoring continues]

979
00:43:30,541 --> 00:43:33,478
- [Seungjun supporter] All right!
- Let him come to you! Draw him in!

980
00:43:35,646 --> 00:43:37,014
- Nice!
- All right!

981
00:43:37,515 --> 00:43:38,849
[Seungheon, Gyuwon exclaim]

982
00:43:38,850 --> 00:43:40,484
[Gyuwon] That was a dangerous uppercut!

983
00:43:40,485 --> 00:43:42,586
- A big uppercut!
- [clamoring continues]

984
00:43:42,587 --> 00:43:44,588
[Dex] Seungjun's in trouble now.

985
00:43:44,589 --> 00:43:47,758
[Gyuwon] Even in close range,
Cho Hyunjae isn't backing down!

986
00:43:49,927 --> 00:43:51,128
[Hyunjae supporter] Way to go!

987
00:43:51,129 --> 00:43:53,731
Seungjun's getting pushed back hard.
He's completely spent.

988
00:43:54,198 --> 00:43:55,366
He can't even lift his guard.

989
00:43:57,101 --> 00:43:58,935
- No, stop.
- [Jongkook] You can't chase like that.

990
00:43:58,936 --> 00:44:00,003
That won't land a thing.

991
00:44:00,004 --> 00:44:01,771
[Dex] He's going
to gas out if he keeps this up.

992
00:44:01,772 --> 00:44:03,641
Slow down! Take it easy!

993
00:44:05,510 --> 00:44:07,845
{\an8}[Lee] I'm sure he's exhausted now.

994
00:44:09,514 --> 00:44:10,547
{\an8}That's it!

995
00:44:10,548 --> 00:44:11,883
{\an8}[Lee] There you go!

996
00:44:15,419 --> 00:44:17,355
He still managed to counter that.

997
00:44:18,856 --> 00:44:19,857
{\an8}[Hyunjae supporter] Awesome!

998
00:44:20,858 --> 00:44:21,859
{\an8}- All right!
- [bell dings]

999
00:44:22,393 --> 00:44:23,593
- There you go!
- [bell dings]

1000
00:44:23,594 --> 00:44:24,662
[referee] Stop!

1001
00:44:25,263 --> 00:44:26,596
[spectator] Let's go, go!

1002
00:44:26,597 --> 00:44:28,198
[applause]

1003
00:44:28,199 --> 00:44:30,433
You can see how frustrated Seungjun is.

1004
00:44:30,434 --> 00:44:32,302
- He can't keep up with the speed.
- Right.

1005
00:44:32,303 --> 00:44:34,838
- He's swinging too wide.
- Way too wide.

1006
00:44:34,839 --> 00:44:36,573
Once the legs go,

1007
00:44:36,574 --> 00:44:38,743
the punches get wide,
because he can't reach.

1008
00:44:39,310 --> 00:44:41,912
[Hyunjae] <i>I'm controlling the pace now,</i>

1009
00:44:41,913 --> 00:44:43,814
<i>so I'll turn this into my stage.</i>

1010
00:44:44,715 --> 00:44:46,717
- [exclaims]
- [♪ tense music playing]

1011
00:44:47,485 --> 00:44:50,187
[Jonghoon] Lock in mentally.
Deep breaths. [inhales deeply]

1012
00:44:50,188 --> 00:44:51,888
Last two rounds.

1013
00:44:51,889 --> 00:44:54,891
- You've gotta give everything you've got.
- [panting]

1014
00:44:54,892 --> 00:44:56,693
Your parents are watching.

1015
00:44:56,694 --> 00:44:59,829
Your mom's got her hands clasped,
praying for you.

1016
00:44:59,830 --> 00:45:02,066
Keep going for your mom. Got it?

1017
00:45:03,000 --> 00:45:04,401
<i>I thought, "This can't go on."</i>

1018
00:45:04,402 --> 00:45:07,504
<i>So many people had come to support me,</i>

1019
00:45:07,505 --> 00:45:09,172
and I really wanted to win.

1020
00:45:09,173 --> 00:45:12,076
So I thought, "I can't stay like this.
I have to dig deeper."

1021
00:45:15,413 --> 00:45:16,480
[exclaims]

1022
00:45:17,014 --> 00:45:20,050
- [exclaims]
- You're doing well. Push harder, okay?

1023
00:45:20,051 --> 00:45:22,319
- You've gotta push harder, man!
- [applause]

1024
00:45:22,320 --> 00:45:23,987
{\an8}[Seungheon] With two rounds remaining,

1025
00:45:23,988 --> 00:45:26,189
{\an8}- can Kuk Seungjun mount a comeback?
- [bell dings]

1026
00:45:26,190 --> 00:45:28,191
{\an8}- Box!
- Moving into the seventh round!

1027
00:45:28,192 --> 00:45:29,726
{\an8}- Let's go!
- Let's do this!

1028
00:45:29,727 --> 00:45:32,729
{\an8}[Jonghoon] When he throws,
throw back! Go upstairs!

1029
00:45:32,730 --> 00:45:34,431
{\an8}Kuk's taking things a bit slower now.

1030
00:45:34,432 --> 00:45:35,733
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KUK: 56, CHO: 58

1031
00:45:37,468 --> 00:45:39,470
- [Jonghoon] That's it!
- [spectators clamoring continues]

1032
00:45:40,137 --> 00:45:42,072
- That was great!
- [spectator] You're fine!

1033
00:45:42,073 --> 00:45:44,041
[Jonghoon] No need
to get dragged into it! You're fine!

1034
00:45:44,875 --> 00:45:46,744
[Seungheon] Nice guard
there from Cho Hyunjae.

1035
00:45:47,345 --> 00:45:49,780
- [coach] Think about the next move!
- [Seungheon] Cho circles around.

1036
00:45:50,348 --> 00:45:53,084
- He's focusing on working the defense now.
- [♪ intense music playing]

1037
00:45:54,552 --> 00:45:58,189
[Gyuwon] When he's defending like that...
Whoa, Cho never misses an opening!

1038
00:45:59,223 --> 00:46:01,626
[Jonghoon] You've gotta drive it in.
That's it!

1039
00:46:02,260 --> 00:46:03,394
- That's it!
- Nice shot!

1040
00:46:04,462 --> 00:46:05,662
[Jonghoon] Nice shot!

1041
00:46:05,663 --> 00:46:06,963
Let's go, Seungjun!

1042
00:46:06,964 --> 00:46:08,598
Seungjun's got a good eye.

1043
00:46:08,599 --> 00:46:10,500
- It's okay!
- [Hyunjae supporter] Yeah, you're good!

1044
00:46:10,501 --> 00:46:12,903
[Dex] Hyunjae,
don't lose focus! Stay sharp!

1045
00:46:13,404 --> 00:46:14,972
[coach] Take it all the way!

1046
00:46:16,874 --> 00:46:19,876
[Seungheon] Kuk Seungjun is changing
levels quite often now.

1047
00:46:19,877 --> 00:46:21,511
[♪ intense music playing]

1048
00:46:21,512 --> 00:46:23,748
[Jongkook] That's it! Yes, that was good!

1049
00:46:24,382 --> 00:46:27,451
[Seungheon] One by one,
Kuk is throwing each shot with intent.

1050
00:46:29,954 --> 00:46:31,922
[Seungjun supporter] Stay strong!
You're doing awesome!

1051
00:46:33,791 --> 00:46:34,959
[Jongkook] Yes, nice!

1052
00:46:36,027 --> 00:46:38,695
Yes, you've gotta work the body like that.

1053
00:46:38,696 --> 00:46:41,698
[Seungjun] <i>Cho Hyunjae kept coming
at me aggressively on the inside,</i>

1054
00:46:41,699 --> 00:46:43,333
<i>so I figured I'd use my reach</i>

1055
00:46:43,334 --> 00:46:46,203
<i>and fight more on the outside
to land more without getting hit.</i>

1056
00:46:47,905 --> 00:46:49,673
[Lee] Yes, use the jab.

1057
00:46:49,674 --> 00:46:50,874
Hang in there!

1058
00:46:50,875 --> 00:46:53,044
[Lee] See? It keeps landing. [exclaims]

1059
00:46:55,713 --> 00:46:56,714
[Jonghoon] All right!

1060
00:46:57,548 --> 00:46:59,616
- Oh, he's resting. He's resting.
- [spectators cheering]

1061
00:46:59,617 --> 00:47:01,686
[♪ tense music playing]

1062
00:47:03,988 --> 00:47:05,556
It's okay! Take it nice and slow!

1063
00:47:09,727 --> 00:47:11,729
[spectators clamoring continues]

1064
00:47:16,801 --> 00:47:17,802
[Lee] He's totally spent.

1065
00:47:19,236 --> 00:47:21,237
- [spectator 1] Nice, nice!
- [spectator 2] Keep it up!

1066
00:47:21,238 --> 00:47:22,306
Come on, let's go!

1067
00:47:24,742 --> 00:47:26,409
[♪ intense music playing]

1068
00:47:26,410 --> 00:47:28,478
[Seungheon] Kuk lands a body shot,
then slides right out.

1069
00:47:28,479 --> 00:47:29,914
- Nice, nice!
- Let's go!

1070
00:47:33,551 --> 00:47:36,019
{\an8}ROUND 7 OF 8
KUK SEUNGJUN X CHO HYUNJAE

1071
00:47:36,020 --> 00:47:37,688
{\an8}[Seungheon] They close in
and exchange briefly.

1072
00:47:38,989 --> 00:47:40,391
{\an8}Kuk Seungjun backs out.

1073
00:47:43,427 --> 00:47:44,428
[bell dings]

1074
00:47:45,096 --> 00:47:46,664
- [bell dings]
- [spectator] Stop!

1075
00:47:47,865 --> 00:47:50,734
[Jongkook] Kuk Seungjun picked it
up this time.

1076
00:47:50,735 --> 00:47:52,737
- You're right.
- He looks lighter on his feet.

1077
00:47:53,371 --> 00:47:55,638
- [Lee] Seungjun did better this time.
- [Jongkook] Yeah.

1078
00:47:55,639 --> 00:47:57,875
[Dex] Looks
like Seungjun's got a second wind.

1079
00:47:58,476 --> 00:48:00,043
He's recovered a bit.

1080
00:48:00,044 --> 00:48:01,244
- Last round, right?
- Yes.

1081
00:48:01,245 --> 00:48:02,779
This is impossible to judge.

1082
00:48:02,780 --> 00:48:04,114
I know, right?

1083
00:48:04,115 --> 00:48:08,351
Each of them had their rounds.

1084
00:48:08,352 --> 00:48:10,520
It might all come down to the final push.

1085
00:48:10,521 --> 00:48:11,821
Let's see what happens.

1086
00:48:11,822 --> 00:48:14,791
[Lee] This is a nightmare for the judges.

1087
00:48:14,792 --> 00:48:24,501
- Kuk Seungjun! Kuk Seungjun!
- Kuk Seungjun! Kuk Seungjun!

1088
00:48:24,502 --> 00:48:27,904
- Cho Hyunjae! Cho Hyunjae!
- Cho Hyunjae! Cho Hyunjae!

1089
00:48:27,905 --> 00:48:29,639
- Cho Hyunjae!
- Cho Hyunjae!

1090
00:48:29,640 --> 00:48:31,341
- Cho Hyunjae!
- Kuk Seungjun!

1091
00:48:31,342 --> 00:48:35,078
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KUK: 66, CHO: 67

1092
00:48:35,079 --> 00:48:36,946
- [♪ tense music playing]
- [Seungheon] We're now...

1093
00:48:36,947 --> 00:48:38,581
down to one round remaining.

1094
00:48:38,582 --> 00:48:41,017
It's the final round.
Let's hear it for both fighters!

1095
00:48:41,018 --> 00:48:43,354
[spectators cheering]

1096
00:48:46,624 --> 00:48:47,691
Leave it all out there.

1097
00:48:48,159 --> 00:48:49,426
[Lee] Man, it's the last round.

1098
00:48:49,427 --> 00:48:51,361
- Last round!
- You can keep it short!

1099
00:48:51,362 --> 00:48:52,830
[Seungjun] <i>It's the final round.</i>

1100
00:48:53,431 --> 00:48:56,499
<i>I'll put everything on the line
and give it my all.</i>

1101
00:48:56,500 --> 00:48:57,600
All right, let's go!

1102
00:48:57,601 --> 00:48:58,668
Let's go get 'em.

1103
00:48:58,669 --> 00:49:00,271
This is it. It's the last one.

1104
00:49:01,372 --> 00:49:03,006
[Hyunjae] <i>Since it's the final round,</i>

1105
00:49:03,007 --> 00:49:05,176
<i>I'll leave everything out there</i>

1106
00:49:05,643 --> 00:49:07,545
<i>and show the best fight I possibly can.</i>

1107
00:49:09,880 --> 00:49:11,114
[bell dings]

1108
00:49:11,115 --> 00:49:12,282
{\an8}- Box!
- Let's go!

1109
00:49:12,283 --> 00:49:15,785
{\an8}- [spectators clamor]
- At last, it's the final round, Round 8.

1110
00:49:15,786 --> 00:49:17,353
{\an8}ROUND 8 OF 8
KUK SEUNGJUN X CHO HYUNJAE

1111
00:49:17,354 --> 00:49:18,989
Give it everything you've got!

1112
00:49:20,424 --> 00:49:21,459
Move your feet.

1113
00:49:23,294 --> 00:49:25,329
[Seungheon] Kuk Seungjun takes the center.

1114
00:49:25,896 --> 00:49:28,232
Cho Hyunjae is fighting
very cautiously now.

1115
00:49:32,036 --> 00:49:33,037
[Jonghoon] Nice jab!

1116
00:49:36,474 --> 00:49:37,875
Just follow up with a cross!

1117
00:49:40,478 --> 00:49:42,446
- [spectator] All right!
- [spectators clamoring continues]

1118
00:49:43,113 --> 00:49:44,881
[coach] Nice, looking good!

1119
00:49:44,882 --> 00:49:45,949
A shot to the body!

1120
00:49:45,950 --> 00:49:47,718
[Gyuwon] Beautiful rhythm right there!

1121
00:49:49,520 --> 00:49:51,354
[♪ tense music playing]

1122
00:49:51,355 --> 00:49:55,092
[Seungheon] He really knows how to use
that upper body effectively!

1123
00:49:55,759 --> 00:49:57,193
[Gyuwon] A perfectly timed counter!

1124
00:49:57,194 --> 00:49:59,897
Cho Hyunjae creates
a dangerous moment once again!

1125
00:50:00,564 --> 00:50:01,832
[spectator] Go! Strike first!

1126
00:50:02,433 --> 00:50:03,601
- Nice shot!
- That's it!

1127
00:50:04,668 --> 00:50:05,703
He strikes, he lands!

1128
00:50:06,737 --> 00:50:08,005
[Seungheon] Kuk Seungjun!

1129
00:50:12,476 --> 00:50:14,210
- [Lee] That landed.
- Nice one to the head.

1130
00:50:14,211 --> 00:50:15,545
- [Lee] That landed clean.
- Well done.

1131
00:50:15,546 --> 00:50:17,982
But that's just one shot.
He's got to go again.

1132
00:50:19,250 --> 00:50:20,950
[Jonghoon] Nice!
Finish it with a lead hook!

1133
00:50:20,951 --> 00:50:22,952
[Seungheon] This is
a spear-versus-dagger kind of fight.

1134
00:50:22,953 --> 00:50:24,854
[exclaim]

1135
00:50:24,855 --> 00:50:26,624
- He's staggering!
- [Gyuwon] Real damage on Cho!

1136
00:50:35,432 --> 00:50:36,432
Real damage on Cho!

1137
00:50:36,433 --> 00:50:38,835
- He took real damage there, right?
- [Gyuwon] He sure did!

1138
00:50:38,836 --> 00:50:40,037
[Lee] You have to go now!

1139
00:50:40,538 --> 00:50:41,539
Fire back!

1140
00:50:42,139 --> 00:50:43,172
Go for it!

1141
00:50:43,173 --> 00:50:45,775
[Gyuwon] In moments like this,
simple strategy works best!

1142
00:50:45,776 --> 00:50:46,843
[Seungheon] Kuk strikes!

1143
00:50:46,844 --> 00:50:48,845
That was a nasty shot on Cho Hyunjae!

1144
00:50:48,846 --> 00:50:50,747
[Gyuwon] But he seems to have overcome it!

1145
00:50:50,748 --> 00:50:52,149
Kuk Seungjun makes it happen!

1146
00:50:53,350 --> 00:50:55,419
And he goes in for the big shot!

1147
00:50:56,186 --> 00:50:57,488
That's it, my boy!

1148
00:50:58,088 --> 00:50:59,222
Stay calm, Hyunjae!

1149
00:50:59,223 --> 00:51:01,324
[Jongkook] You've got
to work the body now.

1150
00:51:01,325 --> 00:51:03,226
- He steps in, targeting the body!
- [spectator] Good.

1151
00:51:03,227 --> 00:51:04,428
This is it. Last one.

1152
00:51:05,095 --> 00:51:08,097
[Gyuwon] Both fighters aren't
just showing simple techniques anymore,

1153
00:51:08,098 --> 00:51:11,234
they're showcasing
their entire boxing careers before us!

1154
00:51:11,235 --> 00:51:13,737
- [♪ intense music playing]
- Kuk steps back and goes to the body!

1155
00:51:14,305 --> 00:51:15,738
Kuk steps back and goes to the body!

1156
00:51:15,739 --> 00:51:17,507
[spectators clamoring continues]

1157
00:51:17,508 --> 00:51:19,342
- Let's go, Hyunjae!
- You got this!

1158
00:51:19,343 --> 00:51:20,710
[spectator] Come on, let's go!

1159
00:51:20,711 --> 00:51:22,445
[Jongkook] Come on, let's go!

1160
00:51:22,446 --> 00:51:23,746
[Dex] Drop him!

1161
00:51:23,747 --> 00:51:24,848
Drop him!

1162
00:51:25,249 --> 00:51:27,818
[Seungheon] In this final moment,
someone has to step up!

1163
00:51:28,719 --> 00:51:30,353
Kuk steps out to the side!

1164
00:51:30,354 --> 00:51:31,956
And lands another body shot!

1165
00:51:33,090 --> 00:51:34,825
Cho Hyunjae looks for an opening!

1166
00:51:36,493 --> 00:51:37,494
Left hand this time!

1167
00:51:38,495 --> 00:51:39,862
[♪ tense music playing]

1168
00:51:39,863 --> 00:51:41,965
- [spectator 1] Nice one!
- [spectator 2] Let's go, Hyunjae!

1169
00:51:41,966 --> 00:51:43,967
[Seungheon] Cho Hyunjae goes to the body,

1170
00:51:43,968 --> 00:51:45,602
and Kuk Seungjun ties him up!

1171
00:51:45,603 --> 00:51:47,370
[Jonghoon] Go! Go for it!

1172
00:51:47,371 --> 00:51:49,205
- Keep moving!
- [Seungheon] Cho stays on him!

1173
00:51:49,206 --> 00:51:50,674
[spectator] That's it! Stay on him!

1174
00:51:51,275 --> 00:51:53,677
That's it! Keep pushing, Hyunjae!

1175
00:51:54,144 --> 00:51:55,612
[Seungjun supporter] Focus!

1176
00:51:55,613 --> 00:51:57,514
[spectator] Time's almost up!

1177
00:51:58,115 --> 00:52:00,183
You're almost done!

1178
00:52:00,184 --> 00:52:02,552
[Seungjun supporters] Kuk Seungjun!
Kuk Seungjun!

1179
00:52:02,553 --> 00:52:07,857
- Kuk Seungjun! Kuk Seungjun!
- Cho Hyunjae! Cho Hyunjae!

1180
00:52:07,858 --> 00:52:12,028
[Gyuwon] Right now,
balance is everything for Kuk Seungjun!

1181
00:52:12,029 --> 00:52:14,664
And Cho Hyunjae needs the courage
to keep stepping in!

1182
00:52:14,665 --> 00:52:16,533
Almost there! Almost!

1183
00:52:17,735 --> 00:52:18,968
{\an8}Ten seconds! Ten seconds!

1184
00:52:18,969 --> 00:52:20,137
{\an8}[spectator 2] Ten seconds left!

1185
00:52:22,373 --> 00:52:23,374
{\an8}Cho Hyunjae dives in!

1186
00:52:26,577 --> 00:52:27,910
[bell dings]

1187
00:52:27,911 --> 00:52:29,312
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

1188
00:52:29,313 --> 00:52:32,715
[spectator] And that's
the end of the fight!

1189
00:52:32,716 --> 00:52:36,352
[Gyuwon] It's hard
to put into words what we've just seen.

1190
00:52:36,353 --> 00:52:37,588
[Seungjun] You did great!

1191
00:52:39,923 --> 00:52:42,359
They were both incredible.

1192
00:52:44,895 --> 00:52:46,096
That was great.

1193
00:52:47,831 --> 00:52:50,333
- Great fight.
- Really well done.

1194
00:52:50,334 --> 00:52:53,804
Man, this is hard to call.
They both did great in that final round.

1195
00:52:54,371 --> 00:52:56,039
This isn't going to be easy.

1196
00:52:56,040 --> 00:52:57,708
No, this won't be easy at all.

1197
00:52:58,742 --> 00:53:02,211
Honestly, out of all his fights,

1198
00:53:02,212 --> 00:53:04,747
I think this one was
the best. [chuckles, gasps]

1199
00:53:04,748 --> 00:53:06,849
- You did great!
- [Seungjun supporter] You did great!

1200
00:53:06,850 --> 00:53:07,951
[spectator] You did awesome!

1201
00:53:10,020 --> 00:53:11,454
That must've been exhausting.

1202
00:53:11,455 --> 00:53:13,557
Huge respect to both fighters, seriously.

1203
00:53:14,258 --> 00:53:15,592
[Lee] They left everything out there.

1204
00:53:16,794 --> 00:53:18,728
- It was an incredible fight.
- [♪ tense music playing]

1205
00:53:18,729 --> 00:53:20,531
Both of you were outstanding. Great job.

1206
00:53:22,633 --> 00:53:26,302
The fight itself was razor-close
and extremely intense.

1207
00:53:26,303 --> 00:53:28,906
It's honestly so hard to say
who won or lost.

1208
00:53:30,607 --> 00:53:31,941
Well done.

1209
00:53:31,942 --> 00:53:35,144
{\an8}[Lee] The decision was rendered by

1210
00:53:35,145 --> 00:53:37,481
{\an8}three of Korea's top judges.

1211
00:53:37,915 --> 00:53:39,550
We will now announce the result.

1212
00:53:40,117 --> 00:53:42,252
By judges' decision...

1213
00:53:45,723 --> 00:53:46,723
[spectator] Three to one?

1214
00:53:46,724 --> 00:53:48,991
{\an8}[Lee] It's two to one.

1215
00:53:48,992 --> 00:53:51,762
[Jongkook] In fights this close,
you often see a two-to-one split.

1216
00:53:55,766 --> 00:53:57,401
The winner is...

1217
00:53:58,435 --> 00:54:00,938
[Seungjun] <i>Along with combos
starting from the body and up,</i>

1218
00:54:01,505 --> 00:54:03,273
<i>I landed more clean shots.</i>

1219
00:54:03,774 --> 00:54:06,009
<i>So I felt I had the edge.</i>

1220
00:54:06,577 --> 00:54:08,612
[Hyunjae] <i>I trusted my stamina and speed,</i>

1221
00:54:09,480 --> 00:54:11,181
<i>so I focused on using them to my advantage</i>

1222
00:54:11,815 --> 00:54:13,383
<i>and fought smart.</i>

1223
00:54:20,591 --> 00:54:22,592
{\an8}- Kuk Seungjun from the red corner.
- [cheering]

1224
00:54:22,593 --> 00:54:25,829
{\an8}RED CORNER KUK SEUNGJUN
ADVANCES TO THE FINALS

1225
00:54:31,401 --> 00:54:33,737
[exclaims]

1226
00:54:36,507 --> 00:54:39,542
{\an8}Kuk Seungjun! Kuk Seungjun!

1227
00:54:39,543 --> 00:54:42,411
Congratulations to our winner,
Kuk Seungjun.

1228
00:54:42,412 --> 00:54:44,615
How are you feeling right now?

1229
00:54:45,215 --> 00:54:49,252
I'd like to dedicate this victory
to my family who came to support me.

1230
00:54:49,253 --> 00:54:50,320
Thank you.

1231
00:54:58,061 --> 00:55:00,864
Even in defeat, Cho Hyunjae,
you put on an incredible fight.

1232
00:55:01,465 --> 00:55:03,233
Please share your final thoughts.

1233
00:55:03,834 --> 00:55:07,069
My mom always tells me,
"Either you win, or you learn."

1234
00:55:07,070 --> 00:55:09,405
So as long as I don't give up,
I haven't really lost.

1235
00:55:09,406 --> 00:55:11,841
[♪ melancholy music playing]

1236
00:55:11,842 --> 00:55:14,143
I'll keep challenging myself,
so please stay tuned.

1237
00:55:14,144 --> 00:55:16,180
- Thank you.
- [spectators cheering]

1238
00:55:23,253 --> 00:55:24,788
[Jongkook] That's a powerful message.

1239
00:55:25,422 --> 00:55:27,190
[Dex] Fighters, you may now exit the ring.

1240
00:55:27,191 --> 00:55:28,958
Let's give them another big hand!

1241
00:55:28,959 --> 00:55:31,027
[applause]

1242
00:55:31,028 --> 00:55:33,096
[♪ uplifting music playing]

1243
00:55:36,667 --> 00:55:38,135
[Seungjun supporter] You did awesome!

1244
00:55:39,736 --> 00:55:41,138
[Seungjun supporter] Well done, Son.

1245
00:55:42,406 --> 00:55:43,639
You did so well.

1246
00:55:43,640 --> 00:55:45,843
[Seungjun supporter] You did
great, Seungjun.

1247
00:55:46,844 --> 00:55:48,544
[Seungjun] <i>I'll make it to the top,</i>

1248
00:55:48,545 --> 00:55:51,982
so you can proudly say your son
is number one in the country.

1249
00:55:53,283 --> 00:55:56,886
[Dex] All right, everyone,
we have one final bout remaining tonight.

1250
00:55:56,887 --> 00:55:58,321
This last bout's gonna be fun.

1251
00:55:58,322 --> 00:56:00,590
Yes, it's a massive matchup.

1252
00:56:00,591 --> 00:56:02,425
It's a clash between

1253
00:56:02,426 --> 00:56:04,127
two of the very best.

1254
00:56:10,367 --> 00:56:12,369
[♪ intense music playing]

1255
00:56:16,073 --> 00:56:18,742
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN
PRINCE

1256
00:56:23,580 --> 00:56:24,948
It's Thunder!

1257
00:56:32,856 --> 00:56:35,525
{\an8}KWON OHGON
THUNDER

1258
00:56:39,730 --> 00:56:41,798
{\an8}[Dex] Let's welcome the fighters.

1259
00:56:42,900 --> 00:56:47,871
Entering from the red corner,
Prince, Lee Chaehyun!

1260
00:56:48,438 --> 00:56:51,741
PRINCE
LEE CHAEHYUN

1261
00:56:51,742 --> 00:56:54,543
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN'S PARENTS

1262
00:56:54,544 --> 00:56:56,947
[♪ intense music playing]

1263
00:57:01,118 --> 00:57:04,354
[Seungheon] First up,
Lee Chaehyun is now entering the arena!

1264
00:57:08,025 --> 00:57:10,394
BOXER LEE CHAEHYUN

1265
00:57:14,932 --> 00:57:17,533
[Gyuwon] He's known
for his textbook rhythm,

1266
00:57:17,534 --> 00:57:21,338
but he's known to overwhelm his opponents
with a wide range of techniques.

1267
00:57:21,905 --> 00:57:24,374
- This is the fight I'm most excited for.
- Absolutely.

1268
00:57:31,315 --> 00:57:33,283
He's more of a point fighter, but...

1269
00:57:33,850 --> 00:57:35,886
Ohgon won't have it easy with him.

1270
00:57:42,159 --> 00:57:43,159
[spectator cheers]

1271
00:57:43,160 --> 00:57:44,827
Looking great, Prince!

1272
00:57:44,828 --> 00:57:46,830
You look great!

1273
00:57:51,668 --> 00:57:53,502
Let's go, Lee Chaehyun!

1274
00:57:53,503 --> 00:57:55,172
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

1275
00:57:56,173 --> 00:57:58,374
- [insects buzzing]
- [birdsong]

1276
00:57:58,375 --> 00:58:00,609
[♪ calming music playing]

1277
00:58:00,610 --> 00:58:02,044
Brings back memories.

1278
00:58:02,045 --> 00:58:04,814
It's been a while since we've hiked here.

1279
00:58:04,815 --> 00:58:06,549
We haven't had the chance.

1280
00:58:06,550 --> 00:58:07,784
Right, it's been a while.

1281
00:58:08,752 --> 00:58:11,587
If you're talking Daegu-Gyeongbuk,
you're talking Mt. Palgong.

1282
00:58:11,588 --> 00:58:13,023
Gatbawi Rock, in particular.

1283
00:58:14,658 --> 00:58:19,495
Hiking is no fun
if you make it about the destination.

1284
00:58:19,496 --> 00:58:21,497
You just walk,

1285
00:58:21,498 --> 00:58:24,100
take in the scenery, listen to the birds

1286
00:58:24,101 --> 00:58:26,403
and bugs along the way.

1287
00:58:28,038 --> 00:58:29,905
Let's see, the candles...

1288
00:58:29,906 --> 00:58:31,474
{\an8}LIGHT YOUR CANDLE
WISH FULFILLMENT

1289
00:58:31,475 --> 00:58:32,608
{\an8}Prayer candles...

1290
00:58:32,609 --> 00:58:34,076
[♪ curious music playing]

1291
00:58:34,077 --> 00:58:36,913
- Pick one and write your wish on it.
- All right.

1292
00:58:38,382 --> 00:58:39,482
- You...
- Oh, this is mine.

1293
00:58:39,483 --> 00:58:41,852
Oops. My apologies.

1294
00:58:43,053 --> 00:58:44,954
"Good luck to Lee Chaehyun on <i>I Am Boxer.</i>"

1295
00:58:44,955 --> 00:58:47,023
Wait, "good luck" is for anyone.

1296
00:58:47,024 --> 00:58:48,858
- Write "champion" instead.
- [♪ tense music playing]

1297
00:58:48,859 --> 00:58:50,426
- Let's go with that.
- [Chaehyun] Okay.

1298
00:58:50,427 --> 00:58:52,061
I AM BOXER
CHAMPION LEE CHAEHYUN

1299
00:58:52,062 --> 00:58:53,130
"Champion." [chuckles]

1300
00:58:54,664 --> 00:58:57,868
[Chaehyun supporter] Offer
your prayers and steady your mind.

1301
00:58:59,302 --> 00:59:01,437
<i>I wouldn't be here today
if it weren't for my father</i>

1302
00:59:01,438 --> 00:59:03,339
<i>introducing me to boxing.</i>

1303
00:59:03,340 --> 00:59:06,910
I'll make sure to take the win
and make my father proud.

1304
00:59:10,580 --> 00:59:14,684
[Jongkook] The fighter facing
Lee Chaehyun will now enter the arena.

1305
00:59:15,452 --> 00:59:20,790
Entering from the red corner,
Thunder, Kwon Ohgon!

1306
00:59:20,791 --> 00:59:22,859
[♪ intense music playing]

1307
00:59:31,401 --> 00:59:33,537
[spectators cheer]

1308
00:59:34,571 --> 00:59:37,907
[Seungheon] He delivered the most
thrilling match in the quarterfinals.

1309
00:59:37,908 --> 00:59:40,643
Here comes Kwon Ohgon,
now entering the arena!

1310
00:59:40,644 --> 00:59:42,344
[Gyuwon] He's a naturally gifted boxer.

1311
00:59:42,345 --> 00:59:46,682
His ring IQ and speed
are his biggest strengths,

1312
00:59:46,683 --> 00:59:50,020
and he fights well
at both long and close range.

1313
00:59:51,354 --> 00:59:54,390
He's known for constantly pushing himself,

1314
00:59:54,391 --> 00:59:56,126
which makes him a very tough opponent.

1315
00:59:58,829 --> 01:00:00,029
You're the best, Ohgon!

1316
01:00:00,030 --> 01:00:01,831
Let's go, Ohgon!

1317
01:00:01,832 --> 01:00:03,366
[spectator] Let's go!

1318
01:00:10,173 --> 01:00:13,276
He just keeps getting better
as the tournament goes on.

1319
01:00:13,777 --> 01:00:17,481
[Lee] To compete with the younger
fighters, you have to keep leveling up.

1320
01:00:26,323 --> 01:00:28,325
[contestant grunting]

1321
01:00:34,631 --> 01:00:35,732
Hello, sir.

1322
01:00:37,100 --> 01:00:38,667
{\an8}KIM MINUK
FORMER SUPER LIGHTWEIGHT CHAMPION

1323
01:00:38,668 --> 01:00:40,470
{\an8}- Congratulations.
- Thank you.

1324
01:00:41,004 --> 01:00:42,172
You deserve it.

1325
01:00:42,772 --> 01:00:43,773
Hello, sir.

1326
01:00:44,641 --> 01:00:46,142
Weren't you headed to Canelo's camp?

1327
01:00:46,143 --> 01:00:48,144
I didn't get any sleep.

1328
01:00:48,145 --> 01:00:50,446
Since you're moving on, come by the gym.

1329
01:00:50,447 --> 01:00:51,948
I'll tighten up your form.

1330
01:00:53,250 --> 01:00:56,953
{\an8}[Ohgon] <i>Minuk is someone
I really looked up to.</i>

1331
01:00:58,321 --> 01:01:02,325
<i>Since he's fought professionally
and gone long rounds,</i>

1332
01:01:02,792 --> 01:01:04,927
<i>I thought he could really help.</i>

1333
01:01:04,928 --> 01:01:06,395
Who are you fighting this time?

1334
01:01:06,396 --> 01:01:07,898
- Chaehyun. Yep.
- Chaehyun?

1335
01:01:08,532 --> 01:01:11,367
He's a southpaw. That's never easy.

1336
01:01:11,368 --> 01:01:14,070
Exactly, I'm here for some southpaw prep.

1337
01:01:14,538 --> 01:01:16,406
[Minuk] All right, let's train.

1338
01:01:17,274 --> 01:01:19,509
- Eight rounds, was it?
- Yes, eight.

1339
01:01:21,611 --> 01:01:23,213
That actually works in your favor.

1340
01:01:23,713 --> 01:01:25,782
- Since I've been through it before.
- Right.

1341
01:01:26,316 --> 01:01:30,387
Someone who's gone through that
and someone who hasn't...

1342
01:01:31,221 --> 01:01:32,222
Big difference there.

1343
01:01:36,526 --> 01:01:39,261
Chaehyun's flow is solid,

1344
01:01:39,262 --> 01:01:41,463
but you can't let yourself
get caught up in it.

1345
01:01:41,464 --> 01:01:43,165
You've got to cut him off.

1346
01:01:43,166 --> 01:01:44,234
Just like this.

1347
01:01:44,935 --> 01:01:46,502
Rather than up top,

1348
01:01:46,503 --> 01:01:47,571
aim for the body.

1349
01:01:48,138 --> 01:01:49,706
Open the body, the head follows.

1350
01:01:50,674 --> 01:01:51,675
Again.

1351
01:01:53,810 --> 01:01:55,945
[Ohgon] <i>The longer the fight goes,</i>

1352
01:01:55,946 --> 01:01:58,047
<i>the less it's about technique</i>

1353
01:01:58,048 --> 01:02:00,984
<i>and the more about
who's stronger in the end.</i>

1354
01:02:02,986 --> 01:02:08,792
<i>I want to show amateur fighters
just how tough pro boxing really is.</i>

1355
01:02:09,426 --> 01:02:12,528
The one entering the <i>I Am Boxer</i> finals...

1356
01:02:12,529 --> 01:02:13,763
That would be me.

1357
01:02:21,504 --> 01:02:24,808
[Dex] Before we start,
let's hear from both fighters.

1358
01:02:25,375 --> 01:02:26,976
Up until now,

1359
01:02:26,977 --> 01:02:30,080
I've never lost against a pro once.

1360
01:02:30,747 --> 01:02:33,750
That's why they call me "Pro Killer."

1361
01:02:34,651 --> 01:02:37,519
So tonight, I'll prove exactly why

1362
01:02:37,520 --> 01:02:39,054
I earned that nickname.

1363
01:02:39,055 --> 01:02:41,958
All right! Well said!

1364
01:02:43,126 --> 01:02:45,160
To make this fight more interesting,

1365
01:02:45,161 --> 01:02:48,664
Lee Chaehyun just added
some real fuel to the fire.

1366
01:02:48,665 --> 01:02:49,732
Okay, great.

1367
01:02:49,733 --> 01:02:51,934
I started out in amateur boxing

1368
01:02:51,935 --> 01:02:54,403
and worked my way up
to becoming a pro champion.

1369
01:02:54,404 --> 01:02:57,406
In other words,
I've already walked the path

1370
01:02:57,407 --> 01:02:59,942
Lee Chaehyun is on right now.

1371
01:02:59,943 --> 01:03:03,545
Since he still has a long road ahead,

1372
01:03:03,546 --> 01:03:06,449
I'll give him a taste
of professional boxing.

1373
01:03:07,183 --> 01:03:09,286
All right! Let's go!

1374
01:03:10,854 --> 01:03:12,588
{\an8}KWON OHGON'S WIFE

1375
01:03:12,589 --> 01:03:14,658
[Jongkook] Fighters, please get ready.

1376
01:03:16,693 --> 01:03:20,195
[Gyuwon] Kwon Ohgon is the type
to slowly close the distance

1377
01:03:20,196 --> 01:03:22,665
and finish it with sharp timing.

1378
01:03:22,666 --> 01:03:25,934
Whereas Lee Chaehyun pulls his opponent
into his own range

1379
01:03:25,935 --> 01:03:27,803
and controls the fight that way.

1380
01:03:27,804 --> 01:03:30,573
I can't wait to see
what strategies each fighter brings.

1381
01:03:31,074 --> 01:03:33,776
[Jongkook] Honestly, the height,
the reach...

1382
01:03:33,777 --> 01:03:36,612
They're almost on equal footing,
physicality-wise.

1383
01:03:36,613 --> 01:03:38,314
Almost, yeah.

1384
01:03:38,315 --> 01:03:39,682
Standing side by side,

1385
01:03:39,683 --> 01:03:41,151
{\an8}there isn't much of a difference.

1386
01:03:41,718 --> 01:03:43,852
Technically, both fighters are solid.

1387
01:03:43,853 --> 01:03:46,256
If there's one issue, it's stamina.

1388
01:03:47,057 --> 01:03:49,725
Remember, slow but steady.

1389
01:03:49,726 --> 01:03:51,727
For the first round, work the feints.

1390
01:03:51,728 --> 01:03:53,029
Go downstairs to the body.

1391
01:03:53,596 --> 01:03:56,498
{\an8}At first, feel it out
and do your own thing.

1392
01:03:56,499 --> 01:03:57,867
{\an8}Let's switch it up after.

1393
01:03:58,635 --> 01:03:59,803
I'm nervous.

1394
01:04:00,370 --> 01:04:02,305
{\an8}[Jongkook] The semifinals of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

1395
01:04:03,173 --> 01:04:04,174
Let the bout...

1396
01:04:05,742 --> 01:04:06,743
begin!

1397
01:04:08,211 --> 01:04:10,045
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go!

1398
01:04:10,046 --> 01:04:11,113
Let's go!

1399
01:04:11,114 --> 01:04:12,748
Let's do this!

1400
01:04:12,749 --> 01:04:14,317
You got this!

1401
01:04:16,252 --> 01:04:17,353
{\an8}All right.

1402
01:04:17,354 --> 01:04:18,421
Box!

1403
01:04:19,222 --> 01:04:20,223
{\an8}Box!

1404
01:04:20,690 --> 01:04:22,057
{\an8}[Seungheon] Here we go with Round 1.

1405
01:04:22,058 --> 01:04:23,325
{\an8}Lee Chaehyun goes right in.

1406
01:04:23,326 --> 01:04:25,728
{\an8}KWON OHGON X LEE CHAEHYUN

1407
01:04:25,729 --> 01:04:27,629
{\an8}[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun is
constantly on the move,

1408
01:04:27,630 --> 01:04:30,767
trying to drag him into his rhythm.

1409
01:04:33,002 --> 01:04:34,503
As for Kwon Ohgon,

1410
01:04:34,504 --> 01:04:36,740
he's staying defensive,
looking for openings.

1411
01:04:37,407 --> 01:04:39,242
That's it. Ride the rhythm.

1412
01:04:40,110 --> 01:04:42,178
[Seungheon] Kwon's got a good read
on his movement.

1413
01:04:44,547 --> 01:04:45,714
[exclaims]

1414
01:04:45,715 --> 01:04:46,915
He caught him.

1415
01:04:46,916 --> 01:04:48,318
Man, that sounds heavy.

1416
01:04:50,687 --> 01:04:52,856
A clean right hand lands from Kwon Ohgon.

1417
01:04:53,656 --> 01:04:54,657
[referee] Break!

1418
01:04:56,059 --> 01:04:58,561
[Chaehyun] <i>His distance control was better
than I'd expected.</i>

1419
01:04:59,129 --> 01:05:00,397
<i>So I needed to focus more.</i>

1420
01:05:03,266 --> 01:05:05,268
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun is
mixing in feints.

1421
01:05:06,669 --> 01:05:09,371
[Dex] Kwon Ohgon sure looks composed.

1422
01:05:09,372 --> 01:05:12,408
[Ohgon] <i>Since it's an eight-round fight,</i>

1423
01:05:12,409 --> 01:05:14,778
<i>I planned to raise the tempo gradually.</i>

1424
01:05:18,648 --> 01:05:20,650
[Gyuwon] That jab landed
just a beat faster.

1425
01:05:21,518 --> 01:05:24,287
It looks like Kwon's got
a good read on Lee's rhythm.

1426
01:05:27,724 --> 01:05:31,127
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun hasn't really
gotten his southpaw game going yet.

1427
01:05:34,597 --> 01:05:35,999
[Jongkook] He's setting things up now.

1428
01:05:36,466 --> 01:05:38,768
- Working high and low.
- [audience cheering]

1429
01:05:42,238 --> 01:05:44,007
That's it!

1430
01:05:44,741 --> 01:05:45,942
All right!

1431
01:05:47,610 --> 01:05:49,211
Lee Chaehyun isn't backing off.

1432
01:05:49,212 --> 01:05:50,280
He's not giving ground.

1433
01:05:50,947 --> 01:05:52,981
[Jongkook] See that?
He's holding the center.

1434
01:05:52,982 --> 01:05:55,452
Lee Chaehyun is staying busy,
constantly throwing.

1435
01:05:56,553 --> 01:05:57,921
Stay calm and collected!

1436
01:06:04,160 --> 01:06:05,895
[Dex] Lee Chaehyun is doing really well.

1437
01:06:07,530 --> 01:06:09,766
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun's accuracy
is excellent.

1438
01:06:15,738 --> 01:06:19,208
Lee Chaehyun's straight shots
aren't landing flush,

1439
01:06:19,209 --> 01:06:21,710
but they're keeping Kwon on his toes.

1440
01:06:21,711 --> 01:06:23,146
[Seungheon] Combo to the head from Lee.

1441
01:06:25,415 --> 01:06:27,183
And follows it to the body.

1442
01:06:27,951 --> 01:06:29,986
{\an8}- [spectator 1] Come on!
- [spectator 2] Let's go!

1443
01:06:32,422 --> 01:06:33,989
{\an8}He threw a big one there.

1444
01:06:33,990 --> 01:06:35,658
{\an8}Yes! Doing well, Chaehyun!

1445
01:06:37,193 --> 01:06:38,994
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [Seungheon] Stop!

1446
01:06:38,995 --> 01:06:40,063
{\an8}And that brings the round to a close.

1447
01:06:42,198 --> 01:06:44,199
Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!

1448
01:06:44,200 --> 01:06:45,834
In the first round,

1449
01:06:45,835 --> 01:06:48,570
Lee Chaehyun landed
a lot of clean, sharp punches.

1450
01:06:48,571 --> 01:06:50,639
He definitely kept Ohgon uncomfortable.

1451
01:06:50,640 --> 01:06:52,674
- He definitely threw more.
- [Lee, Jongkook] Mmm.

1452
01:06:52,675 --> 01:06:56,745
But if Kwon Ohgon gets a good read
on Lee Chaehyun's habits early on,

1453
01:06:56,746 --> 01:06:59,681
he could start catching him with counters.

1454
01:06:59,682 --> 01:07:01,683
You have a read on his timing.

1455
01:07:01,684 --> 01:07:03,453
Use that. Timing is everything.

1456
01:07:04,120 --> 01:07:05,554
[Ohgon] <i>That round was like
a testing phase,</i>

1457
01:07:05,555 --> 01:07:07,724
<i>seeing what kind of punches he throws.</i>

1458
01:07:08,358 --> 01:07:10,792
<i>The plan was to turn up the pressure
from the second round.</i>

1459
01:07:10,793 --> 01:07:13,362
Ohgon's throwing big shots, right?

1460
01:07:13,363 --> 01:07:15,297
You've gotta keep making him do that.

1461
01:07:15,298 --> 01:07:17,366
Work the body. His feet are planted.

1462
01:07:17,367 --> 01:07:18,433
Got it.

1463
01:07:18,434 --> 01:07:21,036
{\an8}- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1464
01:07:21,037 --> 01:07:22,871
{\an8}You got this, Ohgon!

1465
01:07:22,872 --> 01:07:24,274
Come on!

1466
01:07:25,108 --> 01:07:27,075
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Box!

1467
01:07:27,076 --> 01:07:28,176
{\an8}KWON OHGON X LEE CHAEHYUN

1468
01:07:28,177 --> 01:07:30,078
{\an8}[Seungheon] The second round's begun.

1469
01:07:30,079 --> 01:07:32,248
{\an8}Kwon's going noticeably faster this time.

1470
01:07:33,316 --> 01:07:35,517
{\an8}He's turning it up.

1471
01:07:35,518 --> 01:07:37,753
- He's figured him out.
- [Jongkook] Ah...

1472
01:07:37,754 --> 01:07:40,956
[Ohgon] <i>Right off the bell,
I tried to back Chaehyun into the corner</i>

1473
01:07:40,957 --> 01:07:42,691
<i>and attack fast.</i>

1474
01:07:42,692 --> 01:07:45,193
[Gyuwon] When Kwon Ohgon starts
pushing this aggressively,

1475
01:07:45,194 --> 01:07:47,864
it means he's trying
to apply psychological pressure.

1476
01:07:49,198 --> 01:07:50,833
[Dex] Damn, he's fast.

1477
01:07:54,103 --> 01:07:57,506
[Gyuwon] The fact that Kwon Ohgon
is walking through Lee Chaehyun's punches

1478
01:07:57,507 --> 01:07:59,141
tells you he knows he can take them,

1479
01:07:59,142 --> 01:08:01,044
- and he's confident.
- That's right.

1480
01:08:02,078 --> 01:08:03,346
[spectator] All right!

1481
01:08:06,749 --> 01:08:08,251
Good, push him with your rear hand!

1482
01:08:08,885 --> 01:08:11,119
[Chaehyun] <i>Maybe he felt he couldn't win
the distance battle,</i>

1483
01:08:11,120 --> 01:08:12,287
<i>he started pressing forward.</i>

1484
01:08:12,288 --> 01:08:15,324
<i>So I thought,
"Fine, I'll plant my feet and fire back."</i>

1485
01:08:15,325 --> 01:08:16,392
<i>"Let's do this."</i>

1486
01:08:16,960 --> 01:08:20,263
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun is easing
backward, throwing punches as he goes.

1487
01:08:22,732 --> 01:08:24,167
Kwon throws a left-hand double.

1488
01:08:25,034 --> 01:08:26,501
[Jongkook] Kwon's looking for the counter,

1489
01:08:26,502 --> 01:08:28,070
but Lee's good at circling out.

1490
01:08:28,071 --> 01:08:30,405
[Lee] Ohgon's rhythm keeps
getting cut off.

1491
01:08:30,406 --> 01:08:32,175
He can't do what he wants.

1492
01:08:36,312 --> 01:08:39,115
Right there, as he circles out.
Lee's great at that.

1493
01:08:39,916 --> 01:08:42,318
[spectator] Plant your feet
and watch for the big ones, Chaehyun!

1494
01:08:43,553 --> 01:08:44,686
[Seungheon] Nice shot.

1495
01:08:44,687 --> 01:08:46,088
Lee's left hand lands clean.

1496
01:08:46,089 --> 01:08:47,256
Now, to the body.

1497
01:08:49,292 --> 01:08:50,126
[exclaims]

1498
01:08:51,694 --> 01:08:54,429
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun is tagging him
with a variety of punches.

1499
01:08:54,430 --> 01:08:56,131
Yes, that's it!

1500
01:08:56,132 --> 01:08:58,001
Man, that straight is really good.

1501
01:09:00,703 --> 01:09:02,071
[Ohgon] <i>I was pretty shaken there.</i>

1502
01:09:03,373 --> 01:09:05,173
<i>I think I let my guard down a bit.</i>

1503
01:09:05,174 --> 01:09:06,442
Keep moving!

1504
01:09:08,244 --> 01:09:11,614
[Gyuwon] Lee's straight comes half a beat
faster, and it's very dangerous.

1505
01:09:15,351 --> 01:09:16,452
[spectator] That's it!

1506
01:09:17,720 --> 01:09:21,624
- Oh... That was good.
- He's so clean and so fast.

1507
01:09:24,527 --> 01:09:27,029
[Gyuwon] Even in tight quarters,

1508
01:09:27,030 --> 01:09:29,965
he's still landing
a variety of punches on Kwon Ohgon.

1509
01:09:29,966 --> 01:09:32,200
[Seungheon] Exactly.
Kwon Ohgon was the one to apply pressure,

1510
01:09:32,201 --> 01:09:34,270
but Lee Chaehyun
is throwing more efficiently.

1511
01:09:37,206 --> 01:09:39,976
{\an8}[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun's head movement
is very impressive.

1512
01:09:45,081 --> 01:09:46,948
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [Seungheon] To the body, and that's it!

1513
01:09:46,949 --> 01:09:49,952
{\an8}The round has come to an end.

1514
01:09:50,920 --> 01:09:53,222
- [Jongkook] Lee Chaehyun really is good.
- Yeah.

1515
01:09:53,790 --> 01:09:56,925
- So far on points, it's Lee Chaehyun.
- Yeah, so far.

1516
01:09:56,926 --> 01:09:58,794
{\an8}Ohgon can't get his fight going.

1517
01:09:58,795 --> 01:10:00,697
{\an8}- That's the issue.
- Yeah, exactly.

1518
01:10:01,431 --> 01:10:04,167
Keep it nice and easy.
Don't let him connect anymore.

1519
01:10:04,634 --> 01:10:06,101
[Ohgon] <i>My gas tank's still good.</i>

1520
01:10:06,102 --> 01:10:08,804
<i>I'll make a statement this next round.</i>

1521
01:10:08,805 --> 01:10:10,205
You're doing well.

1522
01:10:10,206 --> 01:10:13,241
You're landing clean,
throwing the lead one-two.

1523
01:10:13,242 --> 01:10:14,309
Keep that up.

1524
01:10:14,310 --> 01:10:16,245
And if you're gonna throw big,
sit down on it.

1525
01:10:16,913 --> 01:10:17,913
{\an8}[bell dings]

1526
01:10:17,914 --> 01:10:19,649
{\an8}- Box!
- [Seungheon] The third round has begun.

1527
01:10:20,516 --> 01:10:22,250
{\an8}Kwon lunges right off the bat.

1528
01:10:22,251 --> 01:10:24,720
{\an8}KWON OHGON X LEE CHAEHYUN

1529
01:10:24,721 --> 01:10:27,523
{\an8}Kwon Ohgon's starting to lean forward.
And he steps in.

1530
01:10:29,125 --> 01:10:30,659
[Jongkook] That's it.

1531
01:10:30,660 --> 01:10:32,527
But hey, look how well he spins out.

1532
01:10:32,528 --> 01:10:34,363
If he gets stuck, it's over for him.

1533
01:10:35,531 --> 01:10:38,201
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun fires back.

1534
01:10:39,502 --> 01:10:42,404
[Chaehyun] <i>He kept pressing
to drain my stamina.</i>

1535
01:10:42,405 --> 01:10:46,341
<i>One of my strengths is that
I fire back well, even when I'm cornered.</i>

1536
01:10:46,342 --> 01:10:50,046
<i>So I think I was able to counter a lot
every time he came in.</i>

1537
01:10:50,546 --> 01:10:52,849
- [Seungheon] Lee's right hand lands!
- Well done!

1538
01:10:54,083 --> 01:10:55,752
That's it!

1539
01:10:58,521 --> 01:11:00,323
Nice, the slip-and-rip.

1540
01:11:01,090 --> 01:11:03,058
[♪ thrilling music plays]

1541
01:11:03,059 --> 01:11:05,695
- Lee Chaehyun's timing is excellent.
- That's right.

1542
01:11:06,562 --> 01:11:10,198
[Gyuwon] Kwon Ohgon is getting
visibly frustrated right now.

1543
01:11:10,199 --> 01:11:12,068
[Seungheon] Things aren't really
clicking for him.

1544
01:11:15,471 --> 01:11:17,073
Kwon Ohgon keeps chasing him down.

1545
01:11:17,573 --> 01:11:19,742
- [person 1] The rear hand...
- [person 2] That's it!

1546
01:11:20,576 --> 01:11:21,977
[Lee] Great slip-and-rip.

1547
01:11:21,978 --> 01:11:24,647
- [♪ intense music playing]
- Man, his punches are really quick.

1548
01:11:25,348 --> 01:11:27,049
[person] Chaehyun, your timing is perfect!

1549
01:11:27,550 --> 01:11:30,552
[Seungheon] Kwon Ohgon continues
to turn up the pressure.

1550
01:11:30,553 --> 01:11:32,088
[Jongkook] He circles out again. [groans]

1551
01:11:34,724 --> 01:11:36,458
Smooth slip out of the corner.

1552
01:11:36,459 --> 01:11:38,127
I know, right?

1553
01:11:45,434 --> 01:11:46,601
{\an8}[Seungheon] Left hand this time.

1554
01:11:46,602 --> 01:11:48,771
{\an8}- All right!
- Yes, well done!

1555
01:11:49,672 --> 01:11:51,907
{\an8}And he slides out again.
That's smart boxing from Lee.

1556
01:11:51,908 --> 01:11:54,043
And that brings the round to a close.

1557
01:11:54,544 --> 01:11:56,044
Every time Ohgon tries something,

1558
01:11:56,045 --> 01:11:58,780
Chaehyun throws a jab in between
and cuts his rhythm off.

1559
01:11:58,781 --> 01:12:02,851
Even if the punches aren't heavy,
if you walk right into them...

1560
01:12:02,852 --> 01:12:04,786
- The impact of the collision.
- ...your balance...

1561
01:12:04,787 --> 01:12:07,689
It really throws you off the rhythm.

1562
01:12:07,690 --> 01:12:09,691
{\an8}- [Seungheon] Here comes Round 4.
- Box!

1563
01:12:09,692 --> 01:12:11,393
{\an8}KWON OHGON X LEE CHAEHYUN

1564
01:12:11,394 --> 01:12:14,796
{\an8}Kwon has been increasing the pressure
since the second round,

1565
01:12:14,797 --> 01:12:17,632
{\an8}but it hasn't translated into results yet.

1566
01:12:17,633 --> 01:12:19,668
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KWON: 27, LEE: 30

1567
01:12:19,669 --> 01:12:21,536
[Lee] He's fast, all right.

1568
01:12:21,537 --> 01:12:22,605
He spins out again.

1569
01:12:24,240 --> 01:12:26,375
Chaehyun's head movement is excellent.

1570
01:12:30,880 --> 01:12:32,915
- [audience gasps]
- [Lee exclaims]

1571
01:12:33,749 --> 01:12:35,917
[Seungheon] Backing out,
Lee Chaehyun lands clean.

1572
01:12:35,918 --> 01:12:37,486
Man, he's quick.

1573
01:12:38,120 --> 01:12:39,555
Kwon steps right back in.

1574
01:12:40,056 --> 01:12:41,824
This pattern just keeps repeating itself.

1575
01:12:42,959 --> 01:12:44,059
In goes the left hand.

1576
01:12:44,060 --> 01:12:45,827
This is what he's good at.

1577
01:12:45,828 --> 01:12:47,262
[spectator] Doing great!

1578
01:12:47,263 --> 01:12:51,499
Lee Chaehyun keeps working the body,
then landing those one-twos upstairs.

1579
01:12:51,500 --> 01:12:52,602
[person] Work the jab!

1580
01:12:53,970 --> 01:12:55,403
[audience gasps, groans]

1581
01:12:55,404 --> 01:12:57,840
- All right!
- You're doing so well, Chaehyun!

1582
01:12:59,508 --> 01:13:01,777
[Seungheon] All right! Nice body shot!

1583
01:13:08,117 --> 01:13:09,919
That hook was beautiful.

1584
01:13:12,588 --> 01:13:13,789
[Seungheon] He extends the left!

1585
01:13:14,457 --> 01:13:16,459
That's timing mastery from Lee Chaehyun!

1586
01:13:16,959 --> 01:13:18,194
{\an8}Remember, distance control!

1587
01:13:22,632 --> 01:13:25,101
{\an8}[audience gasps]

1588
01:13:30,573 --> 01:13:32,474
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Kwon chases!

1589
01:13:32,475 --> 01:13:33,776
And that concludes the round!

1590
01:13:36,379 --> 01:13:37,980
That counter timing was excellent.

1591
01:13:38,614 --> 01:13:42,183
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun's strategy
is clearly working right now.

1592
01:13:42,184 --> 01:13:43,985
Despite it being the fourth round,

1593
01:13:43,986 --> 01:13:46,488
he's not hesitating or shrinking at all.

1594
01:13:46,489 --> 01:13:47,722
{\an8}- You've got him figured out.
- Hmm.

1595
01:13:47,723 --> 01:13:49,457
{\an8}There's nothing there. He's weak.

1596
01:13:49,458 --> 01:13:50,860
{\an8}You're not even feeling his shots.

1597
01:13:51,327 --> 01:13:53,962
[Ohgon] <i>Where Lee's punches were
coming from or how they were thrown...</i>

1598
01:13:53,963 --> 01:13:55,830
<i>None of that really mattered to me.</i>

1599
01:13:55,831 --> 01:13:58,700
They were shots with virtually no damage.

1600
01:13:58,701 --> 01:14:00,969
<i>Now I'll turn up the pressure for real</i>

1601
01:14:00,970 --> 01:14:02,604
<i>and take that win.</i>

1602
01:14:02,605 --> 01:14:05,640
{\an8}[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun's defensive
reactions were on point earlier.

1603
01:14:05,641 --> 01:14:08,910
{\an8}The question is
how Kwon Ohgon's big shot will factor in.

1604
01:14:08,911 --> 01:14:10,612
{\an8}- Let's find out in the next round.
- Box!

1605
01:14:10,613 --> 01:14:12,647
{\an8}KWON OHGON X LEE CHAEHYUN

1606
01:14:12,648 --> 01:14:14,283
{\an8}Kwon comes in with his guard high.

1607
01:14:15,351 --> 01:14:16,351
That's it!

1608
01:14:16,352 --> 01:14:17,419
Double shot up top.

1609
01:14:17,420 --> 01:14:19,588
[person] Use your rear hand!
And plant your front foot!

1610
01:14:20,589 --> 01:14:22,491
You've got to answer back like that.

1611
01:14:24,060 --> 01:14:26,161
[Ohgon] <i>The plan was to tie him up first,</i>

1612
01:14:26,162 --> 01:14:28,163
<i>so I focused on attacking the body</i>

1613
01:14:28,164 --> 01:14:30,366
<i>and back him up to the corner.</i>

1614
01:14:33,302 --> 01:14:34,503
[Lee] Nice body shot.

1615
01:14:35,905 --> 01:14:37,472
Yes, that's it!

1616
01:14:37,473 --> 01:14:38,607
There you go!

1617
01:14:40,309 --> 01:14:41,810
He's constantly targeting the body.

1618
01:14:41,811 --> 01:14:44,013
[♪ meaningful music playing]

1619
01:14:44,580 --> 01:14:46,614
Open the body, the head follows.

1620
01:14:46,615 --> 01:14:48,684
Rather than up top, aim for the body.

1621
01:14:50,987 --> 01:14:53,055
<i>This is it. Now's my chance.</i>

1622
01:14:54,523 --> 01:14:57,159
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun is
starting to get clipped.

1623
01:14:57,693 --> 01:15:00,262
Kwon Ohgon is starting to connect.

1624
01:15:01,063 --> 01:15:02,198
[Lee] Yes, just like that.

1625
01:15:03,532 --> 01:15:04,632
[Gyuwon] And nice body shot!

1626
01:15:04,633 --> 01:15:06,234
That shot buckled him at the waist.

1627
01:15:06,235 --> 01:15:08,371
[groans] That one landed.

1628
01:15:09,271 --> 01:15:10,972
[spectator] Come on, close in!

1629
01:15:10,973 --> 01:15:12,007
- Not too wide!
- Go now!

1630
01:15:12,008 --> 01:15:13,375
[Seungheon] Kwon's getting through now.

1631
01:15:13,376 --> 01:15:15,444
[Gyuwon] He looks like
he's found his answer.

1632
01:15:16,278 --> 01:15:17,446
[Seungheon] Kwon Ohgon gets closer.

1633
01:15:17,947 --> 01:15:19,014
Lee Chaehyun backs out.

1634
01:15:19,015 --> 01:15:20,782
[spectator] Yes, just like that.

1635
01:15:20,783 --> 01:15:22,018
[spectator 2] You got this, Chaehyun!

1636
01:15:22,785 --> 01:15:23,952
[Seungheon] And he lands!

1637
01:15:23,953 --> 01:15:25,687
- That one landed.
- He got caught there.

1638
01:15:25,688 --> 01:15:27,423
- Go for it!
- You got this, Chaehyun!

1639
01:15:28,124 --> 01:15:29,491
[Seungheon] Double shot up top.

1640
01:15:29,492 --> 01:15:31,226
All right, let's go!

1641
01:15:31,227 --> 01:15:33,128
Lee Chaehyun looks visibly shaken.

1642
01:15:33,129 --> 01:15:35,865
And when that happens,
Kwon Ohgon will only press harder.

1643
01:15:37,199 --> 01:15:38,968
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1644
01:15:39,535 --> 01:15:43,039
Lee Chaehyun is responding differently
than earlier.

1645
01:15:43,873 --> 01:15:45,708
[audience cheering]

1646
01:15:47,476 --> 01:15:50,379
- Nice shot!
- That one got through. Oh...

1647
01:15:52,982 --> 01:15:54,150
{\an8}- Ten seconds!
- All right!

1648
01:15:55,251 --> 01:15:56,619
{\an8}Go for it!

1649
01:15:58,587 --> 01:16:00,022
[Lee] That was too wide.

1650
01:16:00,589 --> 01:16:02,258
[Dex] He's pushing too hard
for the finish.

1651
01:16:03,592 --> 01:16:04,726
- [bell dings]
- Stop!

1652
01:16:04,727 --> 01:16:05,960
{\an8}[Seungheon] And that ends the round.

1653
01:16:05,961 --> 01:16:09,365
This is the first time
we've seen Lee Chaehyun rattled.

1654
01:16:09,932 --> 01:16:13,802
[Seungheon] It took Kwon Ohgon some time
to start revving things up,

1655
01:16:13,803 --> 01:16:16,438
but in this round,
it felt like he showed us

1656
01:16:16,439 --> 01:16:18,706
how he plans to break his opponent.

1657
01:16:18,707 --> 01:16:21,811
It's one of two things for Chaehyun.

1658
01:16:22,344 --> 01:16:25,814
The shots he was slipping earlier
are landing now.

1659
01:16:25,815 --> 01:16:27,248
So either he's gassed...

1660
01:16:27,249 --> 01:16:29,484
- Right.
- ...or it's that body shot from earlier.

1661
01:16:29,485 --> 01:16:31,253
That was a heavy one.

1662
01:16:32,188 --> 01:16:34,222
It probably flustered him,
took his breath,

1663
01:16:34,223 --> 01:16:36,024
and drained his legs a bit.

1664
01:16:36,025 --> 01:16:39,095
How much he recovers from here
will make all the difference.

1665
01:16:41,664 --> 01:16:44,499
[Chaehyun] <i>I was worried, honestly.
That I wouldn't be able to bounce back.</i>

1666
01:16:44,500 --> 01:16:48,002
<i>If we started trading,
I knew I'd get pushed back.</i>

1667
01:16:48,003 --> 01:16:50,705
<i>So the plan was to avoid those exchanges,</i>

1668
01:16:50,706 --> 01:16:53,409
<i>keep it long, and fight with speed.</i>

1669
01:16:54,410 --> 01:16:56,010
You've caught him a few times already.

1670
01:16:56,011 --> 01:16:57,946
Let's really take him to the ropes now.

1671
01:16:57,947 --> 01:17:01,449
<i>I landed a big shot clean to the head.</i>

1672
01:17:01,450 --> 01:17:03,853
<i>That probably shook him up a bit.</i>

1673
01:17:04,353 --> 01:17:07,423
<i>From there, I wanted to press harder
and knock him out.</i>

1674
01:17:07,923 --> 01:17:09,425
{\an8}[spectator] Let's go, Ohgon!

1675
01:17:09,925 --> 01:17:12,595
{\an8}- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1676
01:17:13,295 --> 01:17:14,129
{\an8}[bell dings]

1677
01:17:14,130 --> 01:17:16,297
{\an8}- Box!
- [Seungheon] Moving into the sixth round.

1678
01:17:16,298 --> 01:17:18,199
{\an8}KWON OHGON X LEE CHAEHYUN

1679
01:17:18,200 --> 01:17:19,968
{\an8}Once again, Kwon Ohgon marches forward.

1680
01:17:19,969 --> 01:17:21,871
{\an8}- Keep going!
- Yes, you're doing great!

1681
01:17:22,771 --> 01:17:24,506
[Gyuwon] Will Lee Chaehyun's
composure hold up,

1682
01:17:24,507 --> 01:17:26,675
or will Kwon Ohgon's strategy take over?

1683
01:17:31,013 --> 01:17:33,682
Combinations are landing at close range.

1684
01:17:35,084 --> 01:17:37,620
Ohgon, throw a hook once he's cornered.

1685
01:17:39,421 --> 01:17:40,755
[Jongkook] He's getting cut off.

1686
01:17:40,756 --> 01:17:42,958
[Gyuwon] Kwon Ohgon has figured out
Lee Chaehyun's rhythm.

1687
01:17:43,526 --> 01:17:45,660
- He's really pressuring him right now.
- Mmm.

1688
01:17:45,661 --> 01:17:47,796
That's him trying to make it rough.

1689
01:17:48,364 --> 01:17:51,099
[Ohgon] <i>Lee Chaehyun was holding up
better than expected.</i>

1690
01:17:51,100 --> 01:17:52,834
That's it! Doing great!

1691
01:17:52,835 --> 01:17:53,903
- All right!
- [audience cheers]

1692
01:17:55,137 --> 01:17:58,072
<i>I knew I had to show something
in this round.</i>

1693
01:17:58,073 --> 01:17:59,307
[person 1] Chaehyun, go in first!

1694
01:17:59,308 --> 01:18:00,542
[person 2] Press him!

1695
01:18:00,543 --> 01:18:01,977
No, he's circling, man!

1696
01:18:02,711 --> 01:18:04,712
Yes! There we go!

1697
01:18:04,713 --> 01:18:07,582
- [♪ exciting music playing]
- Yes! There we go!

1698
01:18:07,583 --> 01:18:08,750
Let's go!

1699
01:18:08,751 --> 01:18:11,220
[Gyuwon] Kwon Ohgon shuts
him down aggressively!

1700
01:18:12,021 --> 01:18:13,922
- Come on!
- That's it!

1701
01:18:13,923 --> 01:18:15,691
Yes! Let's go!

1702
01:18:17,626 --> 01:18:18,627
Get out of there!

1703
01:18:19,195 --> 01:18:21,096
[Seungheon] Kwon's trying
to swing the momentum.

1704
01:18:21,597 --> 01:18:23,232
He's looking to settle this!

1705
01:18:24,800 --> 01:18:26,935
Chaehyun, stay calm, man.

1706
01:18:26,936 --> 01:18:28,303
No need to get worked up.

1707
01:18:28,304 --> 01:18:31,507
[Seungheon] Kwon Ohgon is not slowing
down. He keeps pressing forward.

1708
01:18:37,079 --> 01:18:39,048
They've traded some big shots there.

1709
01:18:40,115 --> 01:18:41,149
[spectator] Stay sharp!

1710
01:18:41,150 --> 01:18:42,785
[person] Chaehyun, focus!

1711
01:18:43,819 --> 01:18:45,454
All right! That's it!

1712
01:18:48,190 --> 01:18:50,859
[Gyuwon] This is a fierce battle of timing
between the two.

1713
01:18:53,128 --> 01:18:54,295
Throw first! There you go!

1714
01:18:54,296 --> 01:18:56,164
Go ahead and tap! That's it!

1715
01:18:56,165 --> 01:18:57,398
One more time!

1716
01:18:57,399 --> 01:18:59,335
- That's it!
- Love that.

1717
01:19:00,669 --> 01:19:02,103
{\an8}[Seungheon] They're locked in.

1718
01:19:02,104 --> 01:19:03,706
{\an8}[Gyuwon] The level of focus is incredible.

1719
01:19:04,240 --> 01:19:05,274
Doing great, Chaehyun!

1720
01:19:06,475 --> 01:19:08,142
{\an8}[referee] Don't turn around. Keep going!

1721
01:19:08,143 --> 01:19:09,444
{\an8}- Round's not over yet.
- [bell dings]

1722
01:19:09,445 --> 01:19:13,349
{\an8}- Stop!
- That brings this round to an end.

1723
01:19:16,318 --> 01:19:18,786
Ohgon is starting to work through it.

1724
01:19:18,787 --> 01:19:20,188
But you never know.

1725
01:19:20,189 --> 01:19:21,823
- All it takes is one shot.
- Absolutely.

1726
01:19:21,824 --> 01:19:23,524
You never know until the very end.

1727
01:19:23,525 --> 01:19:26,262
One clean hook
and you could see him tighten up.

1728
01:19:28,264 --> 01:19:31,266
<i>There weren't many rounds left,
so I started to get impatient.</i>

1729
01:19:31,267 --> 01:19:33,501
[Ohgon] <i>I had to finish it this time.</i>

1730
01:19:33,502 --> 01:19:35,837
You're doing awesome.
He's getting impatient.

1731
01:19:35,838 --> 01:19:38,406
[Chaehyun] <i>I did get hit,
but honestly, they weren't too bad.</i>

1732
01:19:38,407 --> 01:19:40,108
<i>I just told myself to get my pace back,</i>

1733
01:19:40,109 --> 01:19:43,044
<i>and do what I'd been doing.</i>

1734
01:19:43,045 --> 01:19:45,813
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Stay strong, Chaehyun!

1735
01:19:45,814 --> 01:19:47,448
Come on, Ohgon!

1736
01:19:47,449 --> 01:19:48,851
You got this!

1737
01:19:49,451 --> 01:19:51,386
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KWON: 56, LEE: 58

1738
01:19:51,387 --> 01:19:53,488
{\an8}- Box!
- And the seventh round begins.

1739
01:19:53,489 --> 01:19:58,127
{\an8}[Gyuwon] From here on out,
it's a battle of stamina and focus.

1740
01:19:59,128 --> 01:20:00,562
[audience gasps]

1741
01:20:01,697 --> 01:20:04,099
[Seungheon] Both fighters exchange
big shots.

1742
01:20:04,767 --> 01:20:06,934
[Gyuwon] Kwon Ohgon's rough punches

1743
01:20:06,935 --> 01:20:09,438
are going off properly at close range.

1744
01:20:11,040 --> 01:20:15,844
While fighting up close, Kwon's
lead hand is really giving Lee trouble.

1745
01:20:16,712 --> 01:20:18,914
Tag him! Tag him! That's it!

1746
01:20:19,815 --> 01:20:21,282
Did you see that just now?

1747
01:20:21,283 --> 01:20:23,719
[Gyuwon] That was
a perfectly timed body shot.

1748
01:20:28,357 --> 01:20:30,124
[Seungheon] Kwon Ohgon has
good upper-body movement.

1749
01:20:30,125 --> 01:20:32,727
Still, Lee Chaehyun is hunting
for that long punch.

1750
01:20:32,728 --> 01:20:34,062
One more!

1751
01:20:34,063 --> 01:20:35,229
You have him!

1752
01:20:35,230 --> 01:20:36,297
Get in there!

1753
01:20:36,298 --> 01:20:37,632
Nice body shot!

1754
01:20:37,633 --> 01:20:38,933
Get in there! That's it!

1755
01:20:38,934 --> 01:20:40,302
A great shot to the body.

1756
01:20:41,003 --> 01:20:43,672
- Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!
- Come on!

1757
01:20:44,139 --> 01:20:45,139
All right!

1758
01:20:45,140 --> 01:20:46,474
Kwon makes use of that knee!

1759
01:20:46,475 --> 01:20:47,543
That's it!

1760
01:20:50,612 --> 01:20:51,813
That slip-and-rip, though.

1761
01:20:51,814 --> 01:20:53,581
Chaehyun, don't stop!

1762
01:20:53,582 --> 01:20:55,483
- Stay calm!
- Now! Go for it!

1763
01:20:55,484 --> 01:20:56,818
Tag him first!

1764
01:20:56,819 --> 01:20:57,919
All right!

1765
01:20:57,920 --> 01:20:59,087
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun lands!

1766
01:20:59,088 --> 01:21:00,322
All right!

1767
01:21:00,823 --> 01:21:03,424
Lee Chaehyun immediately gets inside.

1768
01:21:03,425 --> 01:21:05,326
Lee's left hand gets through clean!

1769
01:21:05,327 --> 01:21:06,729
He jabs right in your face.

1770
01:21:07,196 --> 01:21:08,697
His hands are right here.

1771
01:21:09,264 --> 01:21:11,367
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun is
boxing smartly in Round 7.

1772
01:21:12,534 --> 01:21:15,203
And he's landing
quite a few shots upstairs.

1773
01:21:15,204 --> 01:21:16,438
Come on, tap, tap, tap!

1774
01:21:18,240 --> 01:21:21,409
Lee rolls and slides out.
His footwork's picking up.

1775
01:21:21,410 --> 01:21:23,846
[Dex] Kwon Ohgon's starting to rush now.

1776
01:21:24,246 --> 01:21:25,247
He's getting impatient.

1777
01:21:26,749 --> 01:21:28,083
That's it!

1778
01:21:30,352 --> 01:21:31,387
There you go!

1779
01:21:33,522 --> 01:21:35,090
[Gyuwon groans]
Lee's movement is still sharp.

1780
01:21:36,325 --> 01:21:37,859
{\an8}[person] Light and easy! Take it slow!

1781
01:21:37,860 --> 01:21:39,395
{\an8}Throw back!

1782
01:21:43,766 --> 01:21:44,933
{\an8}That's it!

1783
01:21:47,069 --> 01:21:48,437
[Gyuwon] Excellent combo!

1784
01:21:49,004 --> 01:21:50,338
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Stop!

1785
01:21:50,339 --> 01:21:54,076
[Gyuwon] And with that final exchange,
Round 7 comes to a close.

1786
01:21:55,944 --> 01:21:57,513
[cheering]

1787
01:22:00,949 --> 01:22:03,117
Chaehyun's got great stamina, though.

1788
01:22:03,118 --> 01:22:04,786
Right? His stamina's solid.

1789
01:22:04,787 --> 01:22:05,853
Yeah, it's amazing.

1790
01:22:05,854 --> 01:22:09,090
Here's something I learned on this show.

1791
01:22:09,091 --> 01:22:11,626
They say amateurs are only good
for three rounds.

1792
01:22:11,627 --> 01:22:13,060
- Couldn't be more wrong.
- No.

1793
01:22:13,061 --> 01:22:15,096
- They're solid all the way through.
- Exactly.

1794
01:22:15,097 --> 01:22:18,232
That whole "only good for three rounds"
is just a stereotype.

1795
01:22:18,233 --> 01:22:19,300
You're right.

1796
01:22:19,301 --> 01:22:21,936
- Even I had thought so at first.
- Right?

1797
01:22:21,937 --> 01:22:23,571
To be honest.

1798
01:22:23,572 --> 01:22:26,074
Skill is skill, in the end.

1799
01:22:27,376 --> 01:22:31,012
[Gyuwon] At times, it felt like Lee was
getting dragged into Kwon's fight.

1800
01:22:31,013 --> 01:22:33,182
But each time,
Lee Chaehyun held his ground.

1801
01:22:34,416 --> 01:22:35,818
As for Kwon Ohgon,

1802
01:22:36,318 --> 01:22:38,653
he is known as a ten-round fighter,

1803
01:22:38,654 --> 01:22:41,123
so he's going to put everything
into this final round.

1804
01:22:41,623 --> 01:22:44,493
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1805
01:22:48,831 --> 01:22:50,866
[Chaehyun] <i>I'll send you back home, Ohgon.</i>

1806
01:22:51,867 --> 01:22:53,469
Let's go, Ohgon!

1807
01:22:54,870 --> 01:22:57,605
[♪ epic music playing]

1808
01:22:57,606 --> 01:23:00,776
[Ohgon] <i>I'm going to
drop Chaehyun for sure.</i>

1809
01:23:01,944 --> 01:23:04,645
[Gyuwon] Boxing is about
that one percent chance.

1810
01:23:04,646 --> 01:23:07,082
The tables can turn at any moment.

1811
01:23:08,317 --> 01:23:09,650
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Box!

1812
01:23:09,651 --> 01:23:10,952
{\an8}KWON OHGON X LEE CHAEHYUN

1813
01:23:10,953 --> 01:23:13,421
{\an8}The eighth and final round begins.

1814
01:23:13,422 --> 01:23:14,957
{\an8}[person] Do what you've been doing!

1815
01:23:15,424 --> 01:23:16,424
[Seungheon] Kwon closes in.

1816
01:23:16,425 --> 01:23:17,626
[person] Yes, that's it!

1817
01:23:18,760 --> 01:23:20,195
[audience gasping]

1818
01:23:21,029 --> 01:23:22,464
[Gyuwon] Yes, that straight!

1819
01:23:26,602 --> 01:23:27,669
[audience exclaims]

1820
01:23:29,838 --> 01:23:31,572
Lee Chaehyun is still going strong!

1821
01:23:31,573 --> 01:23:33,609
Whoa, did you see him spin him around?

1822
01:23:34,576 --> 01:23:36,378
Damn, that was amazing.

1823
01:23:38,614 --> 01:23:40,448
[Gyuwon] Just when his opponent is
about to charge,

1824
01:23:40,449 --> 01:23:42,518
Lee spins him around and strikes!

1825
01:23:45,821 --> 01:23:46,921
[person] Slowly! The rear hand!

1826
01:23:46,922 --> 01:23:49,056
- That's it!
- [Gyuwon] They're throwing nonstop!

1827
01:23:49,057 --> 01:23:51,560
That's insane strength
coming from Lee Chaehyun!

1828
01:23:52,160 --> 01:23:54,262
Great going, Chaehyun!

1829
01:23:54,263 --> 01:23:55,396
Let's go!

1830
01:23:55,397 --> 01:23:58,432
Kwon Ohgon! Kwon Ohgon!

1831
01:23:58,433 --> 01:23:59,501
Go in on him!

1832
01:24:03,572 --> 01:24:05,173
[Seungheon] He slips out to the side!

1833
01:24:06,074 --> 01:24:08,242
And drives in a big left hand!

1834
01:24:08,243 --> 01:24:11,747
[Gyuwon] Lee's speed is still there,
but so is Kwon's raw strength!

1835
01:24:12,281 --> 01:24:14,048
Yes, Ohgon, that's your game right there.

1836
01:24:14,049 --> 01:24:16,717
- Yes, that's his only option now.
- That's his game.

1837
01:24:16,718 --> 01:24:19,121
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1838
01:24:20,222 --> 01:24:21,557
[Gyuwon] And the left connects!

1839
01:24:22,791 --> 01:24:25,294
He works the body, then goes upstairs!

1840
01:24:25,794 --> 01:24:27,129
[exclaiming]

1841
01:24:28,931 --> 01:24:30,498
Lee strikes a combo!

1842
01:24:30,499 --> 01:24:31,567
[spectator] Go, Chaehyun!

1843
01:24:32,067 --> 01:24:33,502
Lee's not backing down.

1844
01:24:34,703 --> 01:24:35,903
[Gyuwon] That's amazing.

1845
01:24:35,904 --> 01:24:37,405
He's still got gas in the tank!

1846
01:24:37,406 --> 01:24:39,908
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1847
01:24:40,375 --> 01:24:41,642
Let's go, Ohgon!

1848
01:24:41,643 --> 01:24:43,211
Go for it now!

1849
01:24:45,047 --> 01:24:46,614
[Gyuwon] Lee still has power in the tank.

1850
01:24:46,615 --> 01:24:47,949
What's Kwon's next move?

1851
01:24:47,950 --> 01:24:51,152
Kwon's still trying
to win it with strength.

1852
01:24:51,153 --> 01:24:53,622
Lee cleverly strikes upstairs
and backs out.

1853
01:24:55,791 --> 01:24:57,658
This is the final round.

1854
01:24:57,659 --> 01:25:00,227
They must keep it simple and just fight.

1855
01:25:00,228 --> 01:25:02,464
[person] Make it count! Don't waste it!

1856
01:25:04,166 --> 01:25:08,169
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun has figured out
Kwon Ohgon's right hook trajectory.

1857
01:25:08,170 --> 01:25:09,237
[groans]

1858
01:25:12,975 --> 01:25:15,644
[Seungheon] And he's slipping Kwon's shots
with smooth upper-body movement!

1859
01:25:19,481 --> 01:25:20,682
[Lee] Ohgon's tired now.

1860
01:25:21,216 --> 01:25:24,085
Kwon can't let the pressure get to him!
He has to stay composed!

1861
01:25:24,086 --> 01:25:26,187
Look at Chaehyun move.
His stamina is insane.

1862
01:25:26,188 --> 01:25:27,255
He's unreal.

1863
01:25:27,756 --> 01:25:29,457
[Seungheon] It's not over until it's over!

1864
01:25:29,458 --> 01:25:31,627
Anything can change in a heartbeat!

1865
01:25:33,228 --> 01:25:36,030
Kwon Ohgon closes in as he throws!

1866
01:25:36,031 --> 01:25:37,265
[person] That's it!

1867
01:25:40,402 --> 01:25:41,436
All right!

1868
01:25:42,137 --> 01:25:43,372
Last round!

1869
01:25:43,872 --> 01:25:45,107
Keep going till the end!

1870
01:25:47,242 --> 01:25:48,976
{\an8}KWON OHGON X LEE CHAEHYUN

1871
01:25:48,977 --> 01:25:51,412
You're doing awesome! Stay sharp!

1872
01:25:51,413 --> 01:25:52,848
Let's go, Ohgon!

1873
01:25:57,252 --> 01:25:58,553
[Gyuwon] Time's almost up!

1874
01:25:59,154 --> 01:26:00,555
{\an8}Lee Chaehyun versus Kwon Ohgon!

1875
01:26:02,324 --> 01:26:05,027
{\an8}Lee Chaehyun's footwork is still alive!
Last ten seconds!

1876
01:26:08,196 --> 01:26:13,334
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- And that's the end of the bout!

1877
01:26:13,335 --> 01:26:15,270
Lee Chaehyun versus Kwon Ohgon!

1878
01:26:25,380 --> 01:26:26,381
Man, this was...

1879
01:26:27,749 --> 01:26:29,050
This was intense.

1880
01:26:29,051 --> 01:26:30,485
You did great, Pro Killer!

1881
01:26:31,386 --> 01:26:33,722
You did awesome, Ohgon!

1882
01:26:34,823 --> 01:26:36,758
We will now announce the result.

1883
01:26:37,359 --> 01:26:38,994
By judges' decision...

1884
01:26:42,864 --> 01:26:48,135
Unanimous, three to zero.

1885
01:26:48,136 --> 01:26:50,706
[♪ tense music plays]

1886
01:26:52,407 --> 01:26:54,209
The winner of this bout is...

1887
01:26:54,776 --> 01:26:57,545
[Ohgon] <i>The championship belt is
within reach.</i>

1888
01:26:57,546 --> 01:26:58,714
<i>And it's mine to take.</i>

1889
01:26:59,281 --> 01:27:01,516
[Chaehyun] <i>I knew it had to be me.</i>

1890
01:27:02,651 --> 01:27:05,519
{\an8}Lee Chaehyun in the blue corner.

1891
01:27:05,520 --> 01:27:08,790
{\an8}BLUE CORNER LEE CHAEHYUN
ADVANCES TO THE FINALS

1892
01:27:12,427 --> 01:27:14,763
[cheering, squealing]

1893
01:27:17,666 --> 01:27:21,535
First of all, I'd like to thank Kwon Ohgon

1894
01:27:21,536 --> 01:27:23,338
for sharing the ring with me today.

1895
01:27:23,972 --> 01:27:25,040
Actually...

1896
01:27:25,674 --> 01:27:29,044
today marks the one-year anniversary

1897
01:27:29,778 --> 01:27:32,346
of my grandfather's passing.

1898
01:27:32,347 --> 01:27:35,117
[♪ emotional music playing]

1899
01:27:36,918 --> 01:27:40,088
After sending him off last year

1900
01:27:40,922 --> 01:27:43,925
and pushing through a difficult time,

1901
01:27:44,459 --> 01:27:49,263
I'm grateful to be standing on a stage
this honorable just one year later.

1902
01:27:49,264 --> 01:27:52,566
I'm incredibly overwhelmed

1903
01:27:52,567 --> 01:27:53,935
and over the moon.

1904
01:27:56,304 --> 01:27:58,306
[applause]

1905
01:28:00,642 --> 01:28:03,278
So I'd like to dedicate today's victory

1906
01:28:04,079 --> 01:28:06,781
to my grandfather watching from above,

1907
01:28:06,782 --> 01:28:10,618
and to my family
who are here to support me.

1908
01:28:10,619 --> 01:28:11,953
I love you, all!

1909
01:28:22,864 --> 01:28:25,699
To me, boxing isn't just about the fight.

1910
01:28:25,700 --> 01:28:29,137
To me, it's an incredible sport
that shows perseverance and determination.

1911
01:28:29,604 --> 01:28:30,739
Here, in the arena...

1912
01:28:33,341 --> 01:28:34,341
My family is here.

1913
01:28:34,342 --> 01:28:38,847
Including my son,
who's around 14 months old now.

1914
01:28:41,550 --> 01:28:43,951
{\an8}KWON HORANG
OHGON'S SON

1915
01:28:43,952 --> 01:28:46,354
He's probably too young to know

1916
01:28:46,922 --> 01:28:49,791
what his dad does and why he is here.

1917
01:28:50,325 --> 01:28:53,227
But someday, when he watches this,

1918
01:28:53,228 --> 01:28:55,629
I hope he'll think,

1919
01:28:55,630 --> 01:28:58,265
"I'm so proud of my dad."

1920
01:28:58,266 --> 01:29:00,201
I love you so much, Horang.

1921
01:29:00,202 --> 01:29:01,268
Thank you.

1922
01:29:01,269 --> 01:29:03,338
[cheering, whooping]

1923
01:29:10,712 --> 01:29:13,447
Thank you to both fighters

1924
01:29:13,448 --> 01:29:15,684
for an incredible match tonight.
Well done.

1925
01:29:16,885 --> 01:29:17,886
Well done!

1926
01:29:19,588 --> 01:29:21,223
You fought so well!

1927
01:29:29,698 --> 01:29:32,366
<i>Between running a gym and everyday life,</i>

1928
01:29:32,367 --> 01:29:35,135
<i>I hadn't trained in a long time.</i>

1929
01:29:35,136 --> 01:29:37,171
<i>This was my first time back in ages.</i>

1930
01:29:37,172 --> 01:29:39,139
If another opportunity comes around,

1931
01:29:39,140 --> 01:29:42,376
I hope to come back stronger.

1932
01:29:42,377 --> 01:29:43,445
Thank you.

1933
01:29:44,279 --> 01:29:47,481
It was an honor to have faced

1934
01:29:47,482 --> 01:29:48,849
such amazing fighters.

1935
01:29:48,850 --> 01:29:50,251
<i>As an amateur boxer,</i>

1936
01:29:50,252 --> 01:29:53,220
<i>I'd only fought three-minute,
three-round bouts before.</i>

1937
01:29:53,221 --> 01:29:54,588
<i>But through</i> I Am Boxer<i>,</i>

1938
01:29:54,589 --> 01:29:57,825
<i>fighting six-round
and eight-round matches,</i>

1939
01:29:57,826 --> 01:30:00,629
<i>I've gained invaluable experience
and confidence.</i>

1940
01:30:01,129 --> 01:30:02,696
To me, <i>I Am Boxer</i>

1941
01:30:02,697 --> 01:30:04,833
is the highlight of my boxing career.

1942
01:30:06,935 --> 01:30:09,637
[Gyuwon] Tonight,
at the iconic Jangchung Arena,

1943
01:30:09,638 --> 01:30:11,873
the boxing ring comes alive once again.

1944
01:30:12,741 --> 01:30:15,944
[announcer] <i>It is the long-awaited finals
of</i> I Am Boxer<i>!</i>

1945
01:30:16,711 --> 01:30:21,215
Before the finals begin,
we've prepared very special matchups.

1946
01:30:21,216 --> 01:30:23,417
{\an8}Snyper, Kim Minuk!

1947
01:30:23,418 --> 01:30:26,054
{\an8}Thunder, Kwon Ohgon!

1948
01:30:26,655 --> 01:30:29,991
Will it be Kwon Ohgon's aggression,
or Kim Minuk's cold precision?

1949
01:30:32,527 --> 01:30:34,662
{\an8}Saja, Myung Hyunman!

1950
01:30:34,663 --> 01:30:36,464
{\an8}Tyson, Hong Sungmin!

1951
01:30:37,399 --> 01:30:39,700
Myung Hyunman's punches
are extremely dangerous.

1952
01:30:39,701 --> 01:30:41,502
Look at Hong Sungmin go!

1953
01:30:41,503 --> 01:30:44,238
Hong Sungmin! Here he comes!

1954
01:30:44,239 --> 01:30:45,373
Keep going till the end!

1955
01:30:47,075 --> 01:30:50,845
[Lee] A new champion will
be crowned here today!

1956
01:30:51,446 --> 01:30:53,781
{\an8}<i>If I'm going to lose,
I'll go down fighting.</i>

1957
01:30:53,782 --> 01:30:55,683
{\an8}<i>I'll give it my all and leave no regrets.</i>

1958
01:30:55,684 --> 01:30:56,751
Box!

1959
01:30:58,353 --> 01:31:01,855
[Gyuwon] You can feel
their hunger for that belt!

1960
01:31:01,856 --> 01:31:02,923
[spectator] I got chills.

1961
01:31:02,924 --> 01:31:04,426
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go!

1962
01:31:05,694 --> 01:31:07,728
[Seungheon] Both fighters are firing away.

1963
01:31:07,729 --> 01:31:09,397
Come on! Stay strong!

1964
01:31:10,065 --> 01:31:11,166
Go, go!

1965
01:31:12,033 --> 01:31:13,267
You have to go now!

1966
01:31:13,268 --> 01:31:15,270
- Pressure him!
- This is it!

1967
01:31:15,804 --> 01:31:17,005
[bell dings]

1968
01:31:40,362 --> 01:31:42,364
Translated by Jisu Park

